(8, 'seo', 's1', 'British Male Voiceover Artist &ndash; &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Guy Harris&lt;/span&gt;'),
(9, 'seo', 's2', '&lt;div class=&quot;santa-intro&quot; style=&quot;font-size:3.2rem; letter-spacing:0.5px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    Voice heard Worldwide\r\n&lt;/div&gt;'),
(10, 'seo', 's3', 'Guy Harris &ndash; VoiceoverGuy. A professional and award-winning British male voiceover artist.&lt;br&gt;\r\nOver 25 years&#039; experience and more than 200,000 scripts voiced, Guy works with global brands&lt;br&gt;\r\nincluding Apple, Disney, ITV, Hotels.com, BBC and Thomas the Tank Engine.&lt;br&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;!-- GOOGLE REVIEW SECTION --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?q=VoiceoverGuy+Wakefield&amp;ludocid=13238741027900894876#lrd=0x48795b5b8bb4d61d:0xb7a63f64e244a5ec,1&quot; \r\n   target=&quot;_blank&quot; \r\n   rel=&quot;noopener&quot; \r\n   style=&quot;text-decoration:none; color:inherit; display:inline-block;&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n  ⭐ Rated 5.0 ★★★★★ by \r\n  &lt;span id=&quot;home-review-count&quot; style=&quot;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;117&lt;/span&gt; Clients\r\n\r\n&lt;/a&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\n  // Dynamically update homepage review count\r\n  fetch(&#039;/api/get-reviews.php&#039;)\r\n    .then(r =&gt; r.json())\r\n    .then(data =&gt; {\r\n      if (data.count) {\r\n        document.getElementById(&#039;home-review-count&#039;).textContent = data.count;\r\n      }\r\n    })\r\n    .catch(err =&gt; console.error(&#039;Homepage Review API error:&#039;, err));\r\n&lt;/script&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;bar&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;!-- SEASONAL SANTA + COUNTDOWN (AUTO-HIDDEN) --&gt;\r\n&lt;div id=&quot;seasonal-santa&quot; style=&quot;display:none;&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;!-- SANTA VOICE SECTION --&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center; margin:40px 0 20px 0;&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n    &lt;h2 style=&quot;font-size:2em; margin-bottom:10px;&quot;&gt;\r\n      The UK&rsquo;s No.1 &lt;a href=&quot;/santa-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Voice of Santa&quot;&gt;Voice of Santa&lt;/a&gt;\r\n    &lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n    &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 15px 0;&quot;&gt;\r\n      &lt;a href=&quot;/voice-of-santa-guy-harris&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; style=&quot;font-size:1.15em; font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;\r\n        Hear the Santa Voice\r\n      &lt;/a&gt;\r\n    &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n    &lt;p style=&quot;font-size:1em; opacity:0.9; margin-bottom:25px;&quot;&gt;\r\n      Heard on &lt;strong&gt;BBC Radio 2&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;BBC Radio 1&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;CBeebies&lt;/strong&gt;, \r\n      &lt;strong&gt;Capital&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Heart&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;ITV&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;GB News&lt;/strong&gt;, \r\n      &lt;strong&gt;Tesco&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Asda&lt;/strong&gt; and global brands.\r\n    &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n    &lt;a href=&quot;/voice-of-santa-guy-harris&quot; title=&quot;Guy Harris &ndash; The UK&rsquo;s Voice of Santa&quot;&gt;\r\n      &lt;img \r\n        src=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/official-santa-voice-guy-harris.jpg&quot;\r\n        alt=&quot;Guy Harris &ndash; The UK&rsquo;s Official Voice of Santa&quot;\r\n        title=&quot;Guy Harris &ndash; The UK&rsquo;s Official Voice of Santa&quot;\r\n        style=&quot;max-width:650px;width:100%;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);margin-bottom:25px;&quot;\r\n      /&gt;\r\n    &lt;/a&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;p style=&quot;font-size:1.15em; line-height:1.55em; text-align:center; max-width:900px; margin:0 auto 25px auto;&quot;&gt;\r\n    Delivering the ultimate Christmas voice for brands including \r\n    &lt;a href=&quot;bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, ITV, Heart Radio, CBeebies, Asda, Tesco and major retailers.\r\n    Need a warm, iconic, joyful Santa voice this Christmas?\r\n    &lt;strong&gt;Same-day turnaround&lt;/strong&gt;, broadcast-quality audio, and festive sparkle included.\r\n  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center; margin-bottom:30px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;a href=&quot;/voice-of-santa-guy-harris&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;Listen to Santa samples&lt;/a&gt; \r\n    or &lt;a href=&quot;contact-guy&quot;&gt;book now&lt;/a&gt;.\r\n  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;!-- CHRISTMAS COUNTDOWN --&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;div id=&quot;christmas-countdown&quot; style=&quot;\r\n      font-size:28px;\r\n      font-weight:bold;\r\n      text-align:center;\r\n      margin-top:5px;\r\n      color:#ffffff;\r\n      text-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\r\n  &quot;&gt;\r\n    Christmas Day in: &lt;span id=&quot;xmas-timer&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&gt;\r\n&lt;!-- ABOUT GUY --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 1.1em; line-height: 1.5em;&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;strong&gt;Multi-award-winning British voiceover&lt;/strong&gt; &ndash; VOX Best Male Voiceover Award winner and 3-time SOVAS (USA) finalist.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 1.1em; line-height: 1.5em;&quot;&gt;\r\n  If you&rsquo;re looking for a confident, reliable and fast-turnaround male voiceover,&lt;br&gt;\r\n  Guy delivers &lt;strong&gt;broadcast-quality audio&lt;/strong&gt; from his professional studio.&lt;br&gt;\r\n  Choose from &lt;a href=&quot;commercial-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Commercial Voiceover&quot;&gt;TV &amp; Radio ads&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;explainer-video-voice&quot; title=&quot;Explainer Video Voiceover&quot;&gt;Explainer voiceovers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pathevoice.co.uk&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Path&eacute; News Voiceover&quot;&gt;Path&eacute; News Voiceover&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;character-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Character Voiceovers&quot;&gt;Character Voiceovers&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;br&gt;\r\n  and his highly requested &lt;a href=&quot;david-attenborough-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;David Attenborough voice style&quot;&gt;David Attenborough impression&lt;/a&gt; &mdash; just ask Google.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;bar&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;!--  VOICE OF GOD SECTION --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;max-width:900px; margin:40px auto; text-align:center; line-height:1.55em;&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;h2 style=&quot;font-size:1.8em; margin-bottom:10px;&quot;&gt;Event or Awards Night Voiceover?&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;p style=&quot;font-size:1.1em; line-height:1.5em; margin-top:20px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    Running an event, awards show or big stage production?  \r\n    My &lt;a href=&quot;/voice-of-god&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Voice of God Announcer&quot;&gt;Voice of God&lt;/a&gt; delivery is trusted by \r\n    &lt;strong&gt;ITV&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Butlins&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;The Masked Singer&lt;/strong&gt;, \r\n    &lt;strong&gt;Bestway&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Poundland&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;National History Museum&lt;/strong&gt;.  \r\n    If you need a bold, authoritative announcer voice that fills the room and lifts the atmosphere &mdash; you&rsquo;ve found the right Guy.\r\n  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;bar&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;!-- WHY CLIENTS CHOOSE ME --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;max-width:900px; margin:40px auto; text-align:center; line-height:1.55em;&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;h2 style=&quot;font-size:1.8em; margin-bottom:10px;&quot;&gt;Why Clients Choose Me&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;p&gt;\r\n    Finding the right voice shouldn&rsquo;t feel like a gamble. After 25 years and more than 200,000 projects, \r\n    I&rsquo;ve learned that clients want the same three things: reliability, speed, and audio that sounds brilliant first time.\r\n  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;p&gt;\r\n    I&rsquo;m in the studio every day, I take direction well, and I keep your project moving without fuss or drama. \r\n    If you want a voice who just gets it right, you&rsquo;ve found the right Guy.\r\n  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;a href=&quot;/why-use-voiceoverguy&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Why clients choose Guy Harris&quot;&gt;\r\n      Read the full story &rarr;\r\n    &lt;/a&gt;\r\n  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;bar&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;!-- CHILD VOICE SECTION --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;max-width:900px; margin:40px auto; text-align:center; line-height:1.55em;&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;h2 style=&quot;font-size:1.8em; margin-bottom:10px;&quot;&gt;Need a &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;British Child Voiceover&lt;/span&gt;?&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 1.1em; line-height: 1.5em;&quot;&gt;\r\n    Meet &lt;strong&gt;Arabella Harris&lt;/strong&gt; &mdash; a 9-year-old professional child voiceover artist with national credits including Tesco, Sainsbury&rsquo;s, and Nickelodeon.&lt;br&gt;\r\n    Her clear, natural young girl voice is ideal for animation, radio, and commercials.&lt;br&gt;\r\n    &lt;a href=&quot;/arabella-harris-girl-child-voiceover-kid&quot; title=&quot;Arabella Harris child voiceover demos&quot;&gt;Listen to her child voiceover demos&lt;/a&gt; \r\n    or visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.arabellaharris.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Official Arabella Harris website&quot;&gt;ArabellaHarris.com&lt;/a&gt; to learn more.\r\n  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;bar&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;!-- BOOK ME CTA --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center; max-width:900px; margin:40px auto 60px auto; font-size:1.2em; line-height:1.55em;&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;p&gt;Ready to book a professional voice that&rsquo;s fast, reliable and broadcast-quality?&lt;/p&gt;\r\n  &lt;p&gt;\r\n    &lt;a href=&quot;/contact-guy&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; style=&quot;font-size:1.05em; font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;\r\n      Get in touch today\r\n    &lt;/a&gt; &mdash; I&rsquo;m in the studio and ready to help.\r\n  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;'),
(11, 'seo', 's4', 'As an English male voice over, Guy voices over 100 jobs per week and is heard across the globe. The voice work is varied and covers most genres. So, wherever you are, what ever you need, get in touch.'),
(12, 'seo', 's5', 'Have a script and need a quick turnaround? 99% of jobs are voiced and returned the same day. Audio is sent back edited and tidy as a high quality mp3 or WAV file. &lt;br&gt;\r\nFrom start to finish it&#039;s seamless'),
(13, 'seo', 's6', 'Based in West Yorkshire in the UK, Guy is well situated for voice jobs required quickly in Media City or Manchester. &lt;br&gt;Or for voice over work in person, a quick jump on the direct train to London.'),
(14, 'seo', 's7', 'British Male Voice Over &ndash; Guy Harris | VoiceoverGuy'),
(15, 'seo', 's8', 'Award-winning British male voice over artist Guy Harris. Trusted by Apple, BBC, Disney &amp; ITV. Fast turnaround. Studio quality. Voice of Santa UK.'),
(16, 'seo', 's9', '&lt;p&gt;\r\n\r\n* How is your breath? Need a freshen? You need the Breath CO Mouthwash! Oh, I voiced the ad! &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0zD403Bp3sc&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;The Breath Co Mouthwash&quot;&gt;Check it out!&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;\r\n* So proud to be LEGO Minifigure CakeGuy for Legoland Resort Windsor. You&#039;ll hear him every day at the Daily Park Opening Ceremony in 2026. &lt;br&gt;\r\n* My daughter continues to do well with her Voice work. Still only 9 she&#039;s had some nice jobs already in 2026. And it&#039;s only Feb!. &lt;br&gt; \r\n* Awesome to be the Voice of God for the TV Choice Awards 2026 for the 5th year running. Hob Nob&#039;ing with celebs getting celeb messages for my daughter.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Shhhhh.... back in the studio exhausting my character voices for a top secret project with Team-17. Can&#039;t wait to share more. &lt;br&gt;\r\n* Currently playing 3 robots in &lt;a href=&quot;https://open.spotify.com/episode/0A8J1ZkTF7EGYX7FTBgCcr&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;The Last Person on Earth&quot;&gt;The Last Person on Earth&lt;/a&gt;. A new Podcast series. Listen for HVMP, D10 and Tin Man. &lt;br&gt;\r\n* My voice of Santa was added to a fantastic animation for P&amp;O social media campaign. I can&#039;t wait to share. The animation looked stunning!&lt;br&gt;\r\n* &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.voiceoverstudiofinder.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Voiceover Studio Finder&quot;&gt;Voiceover Studio Finder&lt;/a&gt; 2.0 launched. Soon to be the No.1 site for finding a local Voiceover booth for agencies or travelling Voiceover artists. &lt;br&gt;\r\n* Listen out for Santa in 2025 on the Global Radio Network as part of the massive amount of money given away on CASH CALL.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Is there a Free Santa or Father Christmas Script Generator? Ho Ho Ho yes there is! The &lt;a href=&quot;santa-script-generator&quot; title=&quot;TITLE&quot;&gt;Santa Script Generator&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Coming soon! Now the voice of Mr Messy and Mr Funny for the Mr Men series.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Is there a David Attenborough Script Generator? There is! We built a FREE &lt;a href=&quot;attenborough-script-generator&quot; title=&quot;TITLE&quot;&gt;David Attenborough Script Generator&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* The Artificial Intelligence of - AI GUY! Professional Human Voiceover or AI? &lt;a href=&quot;ai-guy-human-vs-ai-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Professional Human Voiceover or AI?&quot;&gt;Click Here&lt;/a&gt; to learn why Human First!&lt;br&gt;\r\n* It&rsquo;s Halloween time! &mdash; if you&rsquo;re looking for some &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/spooky-halloween-laughs&quot; title=&quot;Spooky Halloween Laughs Voiceover&quot;&gt;Spooky Halloween Laughs&lt;/a&gt;, have a listen and see how I can bring your project to life. &lt;br&gt;\r\n* &lt;a href=&quot;hide-the-corpse-promo-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;HIDE The Corpse Promo&quot;&gt;HIDE The Corpse Promo&lt;/a&gt; - My Matt Berry &amp; Patrick Stewart Voice mashed up for this hilarious promo. Need a British Male Voice? &lt;br&gt;\r\n* XM Trading asked me to voice their male promo voice. Might give this a go! &lt;br&gt;\r\n* Ideal for knackered parents who like their formula bottle prep stress-free...  The &lt;a href=&quot;nuby-commentator-voice&quot; title=&quot;Nuby Milk Race&quot;&gt;Nuby Milk Race&lt;/a&gt; Commentator Voice. &lt;br&gt;\r\n* Fantasy EFL asked for me to help promote their new product (coming soon)&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Want to hear Santa live on the radio? Check out &lt;a href=&quot;on-air-chat-with-santa&quot; title=&quot;On-Air Chat with Santa&quot;&gt;On-Air Chat with Santa&lt;/a&gt; &ndash; the festive favourite! &lt;br&gt;\r\n* Skipton Building Society wanted to promote their energy saving retrofit products, so I was happy to help with the male voice over.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Currently voicing the competition spot on &lt;a href=&quot;britains-got-talent-competition-voice&quot; title=&quot;Britains Got Talent 2025 Voice&quot;&gt;Britains Got Talent 2025&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* GB News back for 2025 with the competitions. You&#039;ll hear me on the promos delivered with fun and energy.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Thomas &amp; Friends All Engines Go&#039; - &lt;a href=&quot;thomas-the-tank-engine-voice-of-salty&quot; title=&quot;The Voice of Salty&quot;&gt;The Voice of Salty&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;thomas-the-tank-engine-voice-of-winston&quot; title=&quot;The Voice of Winston&quot;&gt;The Voice of Winston&lt;/a&gt; Plus The Blue Troublesome Tanker.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* The studio Yorkshire continues to be hired for actors at Emmerdale and Games producers for local Yorkshire talent. &lt;a href=&quot;voiceover-studio&quot; title=&quot;Studio for hire in Yorkshire&quot;&gt;Book Now&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;\r\n* Take a behind-the-scenes look ???? at my recording setup on the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/studiotour/index.html&quot; title=&quot;Voiceover Studio Tour&quot;&gt;Studio Tour&lt;/a&gt; &mdash; where the voices come to life. &lt;br&gt;\r\n&bull; Ever wondered what life in a VO booth really looks like? Check out my &lt;a href=&quot;voiceover-cartoons&quot; title=&quot;Voiceover Cartoons&quot;&gt;Voiceover Cartoons&lt;/a&gt; series &ndash; light-hearted fun from inside the soundproof box!&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Off to Butlins? Enjoy... The Voice of &lt;a href=&quot;masked-singer-voice-of-god-butlins&quot; title=&quot;The Masked Singer&quot;&gt;The Masked Singer&lt;/a&gt;! Oh and of course, the voiceovers for it.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Nice to add Compare the Meerkat as a client this year too. Internal thing. Can&#039;t share sadly.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* For GuruBox they needed a &lt;a href=&quot;craig-cash-gogglebox-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Craig Cash Gogglebox&quot;&gt;Craig Cash Gogglebox&lt;/a&gt; style VoiceOver. I think I delivered well. &lt;br&gt;\r\n* The voice promoting Gregory Porter&#039;s UK Tour on TV across the UK.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Back on the TV with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Im6SJBtwH1w&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Harpic Fresh Stickers&quot;&gt;Harpic Fresh Stickers&lt;/a&gt; on TV and the Web, thats me.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* National Radio advert for &lt;a href=&quot;https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/samsung-neo-qled-tv-national-radio-ad&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Samsung OLed TV advert&quot;&gt;Samsung OLed TV&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;\r\n* Stephen Mulherns fab ITV Show &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QKDoDngvBjU&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;In for a Penny Seabrooks Sponsorships&quot;&gt;In for a Penny - Seabrooks&lt;/a&gt; sponsorship.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* As heard on &lt;a href=&quot;https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/vernon-kay-ultra-ultra-marathon-challenge-promo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Vernon Kays Ultra Ultra Marathon&quot;&gt;Vernon Kays Ultra Ultra Marathon&lt;/a&gt; on BBC Radio 2 for Children in Need 2023.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Booking.com ran some online ads and I was asked to voice them. Paying for YouTube Premium I missed seeing them. DOH!&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Samsung ran a national campaign for their OLED TV&#039;s and &lt;a href=&quot;https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/samsung-neo-qled-tv-national-radio-ad&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;the voice of the Samsung ads&quot;&gt;the voice of the Samsung ads&lt;/a&gt;?... well. Yes.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* You know Butlins have the &lt;a href=&quot;https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/the-masked-singer-voice-of-god-guy-harris&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Masked Singer Promo&quot;&gt;Masked Singer&lt;/a&gt;? Well, you&#039;ll never guess who voiced the promo and the Voice of God??&lt;br&gt;\r\n* THIS Morning are giving away a nice &pound;1m in October. Guy is the voice of the &pound;1m giveaway promo on ITV.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Each year remaining the Paultons Park Halloween Voice for their spooky events.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* In 2023 Guy became the voice of Santa for Centre Parcs in the UK. Along with a series of talking characters around the resort. &lt;br&gt;\r\n* If you hear the national radio commercial for &lt;a href=&quot;https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/mustard-pit-stop-radio-ad&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Mustard Car or Van Insurance&quot;&gt;Mustard Car or Van Insurance&lt;/a&gt;, you may find a familiar British male voice.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* As the UK&#039;s &lt;a href=&quot;santa-voice&quot; title=&quot;No.1 Voice of Santa&quot;&gt;No.1 Voice of Santa&lt;/a&gt;, you will also hear me this year for Centre Parks and Butlins as their Santa too.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* My daughter Arabella was selected for a nice job for UBER. At 7 years old using an Irish accent too. &lt;br&gt;\r\n* Back on Channel 5 with the sponsorship bumpers for Milky Bar, Rolo and Aero &lt;br&gt;\r\n* The Curse of Alton Manor is the new ride at Alton Towers. Listen to my &lt;a href=&quot;halloween-voice&quot; title=&quot;spooky voice&quot;&gt;spooky voice&lt;/a&gt; on the TV Advert.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Voice of Santa for Capital Radio with Roman Kemp. On Air Live helping give away a massive prize with Greggs.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* CHOO CHOO! Some exciting Thomas the Tank Engine News. I&#039;m to play Salty., Troublesome Tanker and Winston.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Note to add my Voice of Attenborough to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u13Ut3DGAMc&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Distant Bloom&quot;&gt;Distant Blooms&lt;/a&gt; new trailer.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Booked again as the Voice of God Voiceover for the The International Gaming Awards 2025. &lt;br&gt;\r\n* I&#039;ve been asked to help Downtown Radio, Capital X-tra and Boom Radio with the voice of Santa as the Real one in the North Pole is busy.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Now heard on ITV promoting Daytimes as ITV&#039;s Voice of Santa. Need a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/santa-voice&quot; title=&quot;Father Christmas voice&quot;&gt;Father Christmas voice&lt;/a&gt;?&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Wandering round Centre Parcs at Christmas? Heard the Talking characters? Oh, that might just be my work.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Mazuma Mobile tv ads are running and great if you need to trade in your old unwanted tech.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* On Channel 5 you may hear the sponsorship Bumpers for the Movies with Aero, Milky Way and Rolo. Oh, the voice? It&#039;s me!&lt;br&gt;\r\n* What can I say? The Voice of &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0bTcz9Y3a5s&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;MAOAM Ad&quot;&gt;MAOAM&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\n* The Voice of &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UYjoqn645Ow&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Alton Towers Scarefest&quot;&gt;Alton Towers Scarefest&lt;/a&gt; 2022 Television advert&lt;br&gt;\r\n* BBC Sounds needed Santa to host &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/programmes/p0dh6hkk&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;&#039;Party like its Christmas&#039;&quot;&gt;&#039;Party like its Christmas&#039;&lt;/a&gt;. Guess who they used as the voice of Santa?&lt;br&gt;\r\n* As heard on &lt;a href=&quot;ninja-warrior-uk-fitbit-sponsor-bumpers&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Ninja Warrior UK&quot;&gt;Ninja Warrior UK&lt;/a&gt;. The male voiceover of the sponsor bumpers with Fitbit.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Soon to be heard as the voice of Mazuma Mobile across all platforms including the telly.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Voice of God? Trusted for The TV Choice Awards, Awesome Events Xmas Parties and East Midlands Business Awards.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Seen the TV ad for &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2mqiqOcM7t0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;13 Dead End Drive Advert&quot;&gt;13 Dead End Drive&lt;/a&gt;? Oh, you recognise the voice? Yeah, it&#039;s me.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Won the National Savings Premium Bonds? I&#039;ll be the one to telling you if you win! Nice to be the voice of NS&amp;I.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* The voice of &lt;a href=&quot;fifa-22-goat-foat-sheffield-fc-promo-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;FOAT for FIFA 22&quot;&gt;FOAT for FIFA 22&lt;/a&gt; featuring the kit of Sheffield FC &lt;br&gt;\r\n* A nice short documentary film voiced for Vegan YouTube Channel &lt;a href=&quot;vegan-film-voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Plant based News&quot;&gt;Plant based News&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* New &lt;a href=&quot;https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/explainer-narration-demo-2021-guy-harris&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Narration Voiceover Demo&quot;&gt;Narration Voiceover&lt;/a&gt; demos and &lt;a href=&quot;https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/hotelscom-what-else-could-possibly-go-wrong&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Natural Emotive Voiceover Demo&quot;&gt;Natural Emotive Voiceover&lt;/a&gt; reads added to the site.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Working with &lt;a href=&quot;https://festivestudio.co.uk&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Festive Studio&quot;&gt;Festive Studio&lt;/a&gt; we delivered over 10,000 personalised North Pole Tour Santa films in 2021.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Back on BBC Radio 2, Heart, Capital, BBC 6 Music and more as the &lt;a href=&quot;santa-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Voice of Santa&quot;&gt;Voice of Santa&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* With Halloween coming, Paultons park has me as the &lt;a href=&quot;dracula-voiceover-for-halloween&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Voice of Dracula&quot;&gt;Voice of Dracula&lt;/a&gt; this year for their radio ads.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Need a Yorkshire Studio for recording? Kammy Chris Kamara has found mine his new home?.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Currently heard all across the UK on &lt;a href=&quot;hotels-dot-com-what-else-could-go-wrong-voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Hotels.com&quot;&gt;Hotels.com&lt;/a&gt;. The national TV and Radio campaign which has been a great success.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Can&#039;t wait to share my &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EAPfk2vIQBQ&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Singing Hammerman&quot;&gt;Singing Hammerman&lt;/a&gt; voiceover for Boom Beach currently in production.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* More than ok playing Goblins for &lt;a href=&quot;clash-of-clans-goblins-voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Clash of Clans&quot;&gt;Clash of Clans&lt;/a&gt; in their viral that notched up over 6m views in a couple of months.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Super excited working with &lt;a href=&quot;manchester-city-football-commentry-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Midea&quot;&gt;Midea&lt;/a&gt; and Man City FC using my football commentary voice.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* &lt;a href=&quot;just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Just Eat&quot;&gt;Just Eat&lt;/a&gt; has been another great client to use my football commentator voice during the summer of football.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* My Sir David Attenborough voice turned out awesome on a film called &lt;a href=&quot;cracking-ice-david-attenborough-impression&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Cracking Ice&quot;&gt;Cracking Ice&lt;/a&gt;. I love the drone filming on this.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* I loved working on a national campaign for &lt;a href=&quot;pizza-hut-delivery-football-commentator-voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;  title=&quot;Pizza Hut Delivery&quot;&gt;Pizza Hut Delivery&lt;/a&gt;. What style? Ah yes. My Football commentator style.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Christmas 2020 heard me helping Santa on the &lt;a href=&quot;bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;  title=&quot;Zoe Ball Breakfast&quot;&gt;Zoe Ball Breakfast&lt;/a&gt; show on BBC Radio 2 among many many others.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Controversy hit &lt;a href=&quot;poundland-self-service-till-santa-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;  title=&quot;Poundland&quot;&gt;Poundland&lt;/a&gt; after my Santa after my Santa voice was heard being less sympathetic to credit card rejections. &lt;br&gt;\r\n* As heard on the &lt;a href=&quot;barclaycard-fraud-fighter-tool-voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Barclaycard Fraud&quot;&gt;Barclaycard Fraud&lt;/a&gt; Fighter tool television commercial.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Working on a nice little project for Warner Bros as the Voice of Dobby for an attraction in NYC and London.&lt;br&gt;\r\n* THIS Morning on ITV runs the &lt;a href=&quot;this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Spin to Win&quot;&gt;Spin to Win&lt;/a&gt; Competition. Guess who voices the prizes?&lt;br&gt;\r\n* The voice of Ringo on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HeWhEx_QAh0&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Becca&#039;s Bunch&quot;&gt;Becca&#039;s Bunch&lt;/a&gt; playing on Milkshake on Channel 5 and Nickelodeon .&lt;br&gt;\r\n* Curious where broken links go? Check out my &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/404&quot; title=&quot;Custom 404 Page&quot;&gt;404 Page&lt;/a&gt; &ndash; even my errors have character. &lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;p/&gt;'),
