(58, 'seo3', 's7', '&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;apple-voice-style&quot; title=&quot;Apple Voice Style&quot;&gt;Apple Voice Style&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;commercial-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Commercial voiceover&quot;&gt;Commercial Voiceover&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;explainer-video-voice&quot; title=&quot;Explainer video voiceover&quot; &gt;Explainer Video Voiceover&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;narration-voice&quot; title=&quot;Narration voice&quot; &gt;Narration Voice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;voice-of-god&quot; title=&quot;Voice of God&quot;&gt;Voice of God&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;voiceover-imaging&quot; title=&quot;Imaging voice&quot;&gt;Imaging Voice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;movie-trailer-voice&quot; title=&quot;Movie trailer voice&quot; &gt;Movie Trailer Voice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;game-trailer-voice&quot; title=&quot;Game trailer voice&quot; &gt;Game Trailer Voice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;on-hold-voice&quot; title=&quot;On hold voice&quot; &gt;On Hold Voice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;'),
(59, 'seo3', 's8', '&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;david-attenborough-voice&quot; title=&quot;David Attenborough Voice&quot;&gt;David Attenborough Voice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;santa-voice&quot; title=&quot;Santa voice&quot; &gt;The UK&#039;s Official Voice of Santa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;football-commentator-voice&quot; title=&quot;Football Commentator Voice&quot;&gt;Football Commentator Voice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;gameshow-host&quot; title=&quot;Gameshow Host Voice&quot; &gt;Gameshow Host Voice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;halloween-voice&quot; title=&quot;Halloween voice&quot; &gt;Spooky Halloween Voice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;character-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Character Voiceovers&quot;&gt;My Character Voiceovers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;pirate-voice&quot;  title=&quot;Pirate voice&quot;&gt;Pirate Voice - Ah ha!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;pathe-news-voice&quot; title=&quot;Pathe News Voice&quot; &gt;Pathe News Voice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;no-margin divider&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;'),
(60, 'seo2', 's1', '&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Guy Harris&lt;/span&gt; &ndash; British Male Voiceover Artist&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&ldquo;You may not know my name, but you&#039;ve definitely heard my voice... &lt;br&gt;On the radio, TV, apps, video games, or even live events, my voice connects brands with audiences worldwide.&rdquo;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(61, 'seo2', 's2', '&lt;h2&gt;Your Trusted &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;British Male Voiceover&lt;/span&gt; Artist&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Need a British male voiceover that hits the mark every time?&lt;br&gt;25 years of experience and more than 100,000 scripts recorded, I&rsquo;ve voiced for top global brands including &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/apple-voice-style&quot; title=&quot;Apple voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;Apple&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/disney-store-marvel-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Disney voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;Disney&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice&quot; title=&quot;ITV voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;ITV&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa&quot; title=&quot;BBC Radio 2 voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;. Warm, natural narration to high-energy character reads for commercials, explainer videos, eLearning, games, and more.&lt;br&gt;\r\n\r\nAs a multi-award-winning UK voiceover artist, clients come to me for quality, speed, and reliability. I deliver broadcast-ready audio from my pro studio, fast turnaround, easy communication, no drama. Let&rsquo;s bring your script to life.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;'),
(62, 'seo2', 's3', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Versatile Voiceovers&lt;/span&gt; for Every Brief&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;From &lt;a href=&quot;/commercial-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;commercial voiceovers&quot;&gt;TV commercials&lt;/a&gt; and narration to animation, live events, and game trailers, I deliver voiceovers tailored to each unique project. I&rsquo;ve voiced &lt;span class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;Salty in Thomas &amp; Friends&lt;/span&gt;, narrated documentaries, and served as the Voice of God for global events like the International Gaming Awards.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Need something natural and sincere? Or a bold character voice that steals the show? Whether you&rsquo;re after friendly, formal, funny or full-blown drama, I&rsquo;ve got it covered.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;As a seasoned British male voiceover artist, I&rsquo;ve adapted my delivery across countless industries &ndash; tech, retail, entertainment, education, finance, always keeping the end result crisp, compelling, and bang on brief. I&#039;m happy with thousands of words too.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;'),
(63, 'seo2', 's4', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;The Voice Behind Big Brands&lt;/span&gt; &ndash; Trusted, Booked, Proven&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;From global names like Samsung and Booking.com to national staples like the BBC, ITV, and Heart Radio, brands trust me to bring their message to life. I&rsquo;ve added cheeky charm to &lt;a href=&quot;/seabrooks-in-for-a-penny-sponsor-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;In for a Penny Voiceover&quot;&gt;In for a Penny&lt;/a&gt; on ITV, brought festive sparkle as &lt;a href=&quot;/santa-voice&quot; title=&quot;Santa Voice&quot;&gt;Santa on Capital Radio&lt;/a&gt;, and delivered clear, friendly narration for Alton Towers&rsquo; safety announcements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Each project, big or small, receives the same level of professionalism and polish. When it matters most, clients know they can count on me to deliver voiceovers that are memorable, engaging, and right on brief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;'),
(64, 'seo2', 's5', '&lt;h2&gt;Bringing &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Characters&lt;/span&gt; to Life&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Need a voice that adds real character? From &lt;a href=&quot;/thomas-the-tank-engine-voice-of-salty&quot; title=&quot;Salty the Dockyard Diesel Voice&quot;&gt;Salty&lt;/a&gt; and Winston in &lt;em&gt;Thomas &amp; Friends&lt;/em&gt; to Dracula at Paultons Park, I bring distinctive voices to animation and theme parks. My characters bring warmth, humour, and unmistakable personality to every project.\r\n&lt;br&gt;\r\nTrusted for my &lt;a href=&quot;david-attenborough-voice&quot; title=&quot;David Attenborough Impression&quot;&gt;David Attenborough impression&lt;/a&gt;, used in films and promos, I voice characters for shows, events and radio ads and I voice goblins in &lt;a href=&quot;/clash-of-clans-goblins-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Clash of Clans Goblin Voiceover&quot;&gt;Clash of Clans&lt;/a&gt;. My &lt;a href=&quot;/animation-voiceovers&quot; title=&quot;Animation Voiceover Artist&quot;&gt;animation voiceover work&lt;/a&gt; spans gaming, cartoons, and branded storytelling, combining creativity with precision to craft unforgettable characters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;'),
(65, 'seo2', 's6', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Professional Studio for &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Broadcast-Quality Audio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Based in West Yorkshire, I record from a fully equipped, state-of-the-art voiceover studio used daily by clients worldwide. Featuring premium microphones like the Neumann U87 and MKH 416, plus Source Connect and Cleanfeed for remote sessions, my setup guarantees exceptional sound quality.&lt;br&gt;\r\n\r\nWith 24-hour turnaround on most projects, you&rsquo;ll get your audio fast and polished. TV, radio, or digital platforms, my &lt;a href=&quot;/voiceover-studio&quot; title=&quot;Voiceover Studio Setup&quot;&gt;professional recording studio&lt;/a&gt; ensures broadcast-quality results every time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;'),
(66, 'seo2', 's7', 'British Male Voiceover | Guy Harris &ndash; Trusted UK Voice'),
(67, 'seo2', 's8', 'Award-winning British male voiceover artist Guy Harris. Trusted by Apple, Disney, BBC &amp; more. 24+ years of voiceovers for TV, radio, gaming &amp; events.'),
(68, 'seo4', 's1', 'Commercial Voiceovers &ndash; Apple Style from Voiceover Guy'),
(69, 'seo4', 's2', 'Searching a British Commercial Voiceover - Apple Style or Hard Sell for your Radio, Web or TV Commercial? - Get in touch to hear the voiceover demos here.'),
(70, 'seo4', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;Commercial&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt; Voiceover&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Commercial Voiceover scene is a huge part of my day. Booking and delivering over 100 jobs a week.&lt;br&gt;\r\nYou will have heard this voice on TV &amp; Radio. Alongside In-Store, YouTube videos and on-hold.&lt;br&gt;\r\nIt&rsquo;s also the calm, conversational style used in the &lt;a href=&quot;/apple-voice-style&quot; title=&quot;Apple Voice Style Voiceover&quot;&gt;Apple iPhone TV ads&lt;/a&gt;, which many clients reference when requesting a natural and trustworthy tone.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(71, 'seo4', 's4', '&lt;h2&gt;The &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Disney &amp; Universal&lt;/span&gt; commercials&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;You may have seen Attraction Tickets Direct on TV. &lt;br&gt;\r\nWorking alongside &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tXTUPXCCwd8&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Attraction Tickets Direct&quot;&gt;ATD&lt;/a&gt; and Disney, I&rsquo;ve been booked many times for their promotions and offers.&lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.universalorlando.com/web/en/gb&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Universal Studios Tickets&quot;&gt;Universal Studios&lt;/a&gt; also asked for my commercial voice to promote their latest ticket deal. These are just one of dozens of &lt;a href=&quot;/vodafone-natural-voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Vodafone commercial&quot;&gt;commercial projects&lt;/a&gt; I put my voice on every week.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(72, 'seo4', 's5', '&lt;h2&gt;The &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Natural&lt;/span&gt; Voice Style&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Over the years, I&rsquo;ve been known for my character voices. I wanted to offer more and show the versatility in my straight spoken voice. Aiming for a new market, this style suits a variety of new voice projects and I&rsquo;ve enjoyed every one. Have a look through the clients on my &lt;a href=&quot;/voiceover-news&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Guy Harris News &amp; Blog&quot;&gt;Voiceover News&lt;/a&gt; page for more.&lt;br&gt;\r\nThis is how it was used for &lt;a href=&quot;/hotels-dot-com-what-else-could-go-wrong-voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Hotels.com&quot;&gt;Hotels.com&lt;/a&gt;. You&rsquo;ll also hear this tone in my &lt;a href=&quot;/apple-voice-style&quot; title=&quot;Apple Voice Style Voiceover&quot;&gt;Apple voiceover work&lt;/a&gt; &mdash; ideal for clean, confident, British narration.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(73, 'seo4', 's6', '&lt;h2&gt;The &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Commercial&lt;/span&gt; Voice&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Whilst the hard sell is still very well used and important in the right script, more commercials are written for a very understated, honest and reassuring natural read style. Something I&rsquo;ve been developing for the last 8 years.&lt;br&gt;\r\nMy natural voiceover is in demand daily.&lt;br&gt;\r\nWeb Videos, &lt;a href=&quot;/explainer-video-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Explainer Videos&quot;&gt;Explainer Videos&lt;/a&gt; and How to Videos are on the increase and this natural, non hard sell approach is also another option for your commercials.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2&gt;Why use a &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Voice&lt;/span&gt;over?&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It&rsquo;s pretty clear really that using a voice over will improve your brand image especially if it&rsquo;s to replace something recorded by a friend on a cheap mic and a lap top. Choosing a professional voiceover will bring credibility to your brand and reflect your company&rsquo;s values. Don&rsquo;t let money stand in the way of your final public facing end product.&lt;br&gt;\r\nCheck out the demo reel here and then call or email your enquiry along with some usage details by &lt;a href=&quot;/contact-guy&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;contact Guy&quot;&gt;clicking here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(74, 'seo4', 's7', 'ch6LhC-vqEA'),
(75, 'seo4', 's8', 'kxB1NMpHSes'),
(76, 'seo5', 's1', 'Apple Voice Style &ndash; British Male Voice | Guy Harris'),
(77, 'seo5', 's2', 'Guy Harris voiced the iconic Apple iPhone TV ads. His calm, sincere, British male voice is now in demand for explainer videos, ads, and brand campaigns.');
INSERT INTO `options` (`id`, `group`, `item`, `value`) VALUES
(78, 'seo5', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Apple&lt;/span&gt; Style Voice&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;What is the Apple Voice Style or &#039;Voice of Apple&#039;? It&rsquo;s that warm, natural, and sincere tone &mdash; famously delivered by Jony Ive and echoed in Apple&rsquo;s TV advertising.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It&rsquo;s understated, intelligent, and effortlessly clear. These days, many clients request &ldquo;that Apple tone&rdquo; for explainer videos, TV spots, and brand narrations &mdash; referencing my original Apple TV ads as their benchmark.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(79, 'seo5', 's4', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;iPhone&lt;/span&gt; TV adverts&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Since voicing the Apple iPhone 5 TV ads, this voice style has become one of my most requested reads &mdash; ideal for &lt;a href=&quot;/seabrooks-in-for-a-penny-sponsor-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;British TV Advert Voice&quot;&gt;TV&lt;/a&gt;, Radio, &lt;a href=&quot;/what-is-explainer-video-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;British Explainer Voiceover&quot;&gt;Web Explainer Videos&lt;/a&gt;, and even &lt;a href=&quot;/explainer-video-voice&quot; title=&quot;British eLearning Voiceover&quot;&gt;eLearning&lt;/a&gt; or in-store announcements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The tone is simple, elegant, and precise. A &lt;a href=&quot;/commercial-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;British Commercial Voiceover&quot;&gt;British commercial voiceover&lt;/a&gt; style that lets the product do the talking.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Watch the TV ad I voiced here &mdash; broadcast across the UAE and admired for its quiet confidence.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(80, 'seo5', 's5', '&lt;h2&gt;The &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Guy&lt;/span&gt; next door&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The same relaxed, confident tone was used for SEAT&rsquo;s &lt;em&gt;Hidden Heroes&lt;/em&gt; series. They needed a calm and conversational narrator to spotlight the people behind their iconic cars &mdash; and this Apple-style voice was the perfect fit.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Watch the SEAT promo &mdash; it&rsquo;s a great showcase of how this voice style adapts to human storytelling.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(81, 'seo5', 's6', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Relax&lt;/span&gt; and take it easy&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Watch the demos &mdash; and if this natural, Apple-inspired voice is what you&rsquo;re after, just get a client approval and we&rsquo;ll take it from there.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It&rsquo;s as simple as an Apple product &mdash; clean from start to finish.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Apple is known for its simplicity and service. I try to reflect that in everything I do, especially when voicing &lt;a href=&quot;/microsoft-cloud-explainer-video&quot; title=&quot;Explainer Voiceover&quot;&gt;explainer content&lt;/a&gt; or calm brand narration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/contact-guy&quot; title=&quot;Get in touch via the contact page&quot;&gt;Drop me a line&lt;/a&gt; today &mdash; let&rsquo;s create something smart, stylish, and human.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(82, 'seo5', 's7', 'V6HuBB4WqxQ'),
(83, 'seo5', 's8', 'TV5U0bZm32g'),
(84, 'seo6', 's1', 'Narration Voiceover - Natural English Voice | Guy Harris'),
(85, 'seo6', 's2', 'Narration Voiceover Demo - Voice over Guy Harris voices dozens of corporate and e-learning narrations each week. Experienced and professional.'),
(86, 'seo6', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Narration&lt;/span&gt; Voiceover&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve spent 16+ years in narration. Book a voice with experience and credibility. A voice that can relate to your product.&lt;br&gt;\r\nThe voice you choose represents your brand. Don&rsquo;t fall into the trap of allowing any voice to do it at the expense of cost.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(87, 'seo6', 's4', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Choosing &lt;/span&gt;the Narrator&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The narrator is a personal character or a non-personal voice that the creator of the story develops to deliver information to the audience, particularly about the plot. When it comes to the image of a company and you&rsquo;ve spent all that time and effort creating your awesome brand, don&rsquo;t settle for anything less than the best.&lt;br&gt;\r\nThis is a job was to promote water usage and where it comes from.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(88, 'seo6', 's5', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Trust a voice with&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt; Experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Book a voice with credibility. A voice that fits well with your product, brand and message.&lt;br&gt;\r\nDon&#039;t allow cost to stand in the way of the right choice. I will never take a job unless I&#039;m 100% right for it.&lt;br&gt;\r\nThis is a great animation to promote media monitoring company PhoenixPB. They and myself were very happy with the end result. \r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(89, 'seo6', 's6', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;How&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt; Easy?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Let me give you a custom read first. Sure, I can send you regular demo, but a bespoke version gives you a better idea of how my voice fits with your brand.&lt;br&gt;\r\nOnce you have the final approved script, a high quality WAV is delivered back to you the same day, (99% of the time) edited and de breathed should you require.&lt;br&gt;\r\nThe quote can also include amends or minor pick ups too. \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;contact-guy&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Get in touch via the contact page&quot;&gt;Get in touch&lt;/a&gt; now and lets get started.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(90, 'seo6', 's7', 'n5aOJKGhcB0'),
(91, 'seo6', 's8', '22hxKsJPEpI'),
(92, 'seo7', 's1', 'Voice of God Announcer &ndash; Live Event &amp; Awards Voiceover'),
(93, 'seo7', 's2', 'Voice of God announcer for awards ceremonies, arena tours and major live events. Powerful delivery, fast turnaround and pre-recorded options. Trusted by ITV, Bu'),
(94, 'seo7', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Voice of God&lt;/span&gt; Announcer &amp; Voiceover&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Voice of God is the powerful, unmistakable live event announcer voice that guides audiences through major events, theatre shows, awards ceremonies and arena tours.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;I&rsquo;m the voice behind: &ldquo;Ladies and Gentlemen, please take your seats&hellip;&rdquo; and dozens of other iconic announcements heard across the UK and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;From huge arena productions to corporate keynotes, brands trust me to deliver impactful, perfectly timed announcements that lift the entire event.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(95, 'seo7', 's4', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;What is&lt;/span&gt; The Voice of God?&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For many years I&rsquo;ve been providing Voice of God announcements for major live events, concerts, award shows and brand experiences.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;I&rsquo;ve voiced shows for ITV, TV Choice, Butlins, Bestway, the National History Museum and more.  \r\nI&rsquo;m also the big &ldquo;competition voice&rdquo; on &lt;a href=&quot;/britains-got-talent-competition-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;Britain&rsquo;s Got Talent&lt;/a&gt; &ndash; a huge 2025 credit.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;When &lt;a href=&quot;/maskedsinger-voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;The Masked Singer&lt;/a&gt; arrived at Butlins, they needed the full Voice of God treatment. I stepped in to bring the live show together.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;I&rsquo;ve also supplied the booming, festive Voice of God for large-scale Christmas events, including &lt;a href=&quot;/christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;Santa-voiced fireworks displays&lt;/a&gt; where I voiced every announcement throughout the show.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;!-- Mini Player --&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;margin:20px 0;&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;audio controls style=&quot;width:100%; max-width:420px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;source src=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/audio/voice-of-god-showreel-voiceover-guy-harris.mp3&quot; type=&quot;audio/mpeg&quot;&gt;\r\n    Your browser does not support the audio element.\r\n  &lt;/audio&gt;\r\n  &lt;p style=&quot;font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    Voice of God Voiceover Showreel &ndash; Guy Harris (1m 27s)\r\n  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;'),
(96, 'seo7', 's5', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Oh my&hellip; Voice of God&lt;/span&gt; &ndash; It&rsquo;s The Big Weekend&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;My Voice of God delivery has been used on BBC Radio 1, Radio 2 and by top imaging teams for promos, trails and arena intros.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;I voiced the deep, impactful announcements for &lt;a href=&quot;https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/bbc-radio-1-big-weekend&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;BBC Radio 1&rsquo;s Big Weekend&lt;/a&gt; and the live tour version of &lt;a href=&quot;/saturday-night-takeaway-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;Ant &amp; Dec&rsquo;s Saturday Night Takeaway&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Event organisers also hire me for specialist roles, including:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n  &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/qatar-drone-race-psg-voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;PSG Qatar Drone Race &ndash; Football Style Commentary&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n  &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;Patrick Stewart style announcer &ndash; European Collaboration Summit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n  &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/ninja-warrior-uk-fitbit-sponsor-bumpers&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;Ninja Warrior UK &ndash; Sponsor bumpers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you&rsquo;ve ever stayed at Butlins, there&rsquo;s a high chance you&rsquo;ve heard my Voice of God echoing through their venues.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(97, 'seo7', 's6', '&lt;h2&gt;Contact &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;God&lt;/span&gt; for Your Event&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;I&rsquo;ve voiced major events for Asperity, BBC Radio 1, National Fitness Awards, Alhambra Theatre, Jewsons, Walkers, Butlins, Warners, RBS and many more.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nBrands rely on me for tight, perfectly timed delivery &ndash; whether pre-recorded or live.  \r\nThe team behind &lt;a href=&quot;/britains-got-talent-competition-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;Britain&rsquo;s Got Talent&lt;/a&gt; trusted me for their competition-voice segments, and event organisers return year after year for Christmas announcements, award show intros and gala ceremonies.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nTechnology allows for last-minute changes, same-day audio delivery and seamless integration into your event.  \r\nSo don&rsquo;t panic &mdash; I&rsquo;ve got it covered.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nFor live award ceremonies, arena tours and corporate shows, visit my dedicated\r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://voiceofgod.co.uk&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Voice of God Announcer&quot;&gt;Voice of God announcer site&lt;/a&gt;\r\nfor examples and booking information.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\n&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/contact-guy&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Contact Guy Harris&quot;&gt;Get in touch today&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;\r\nand let me know what needs hosting or voicing.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(98, 'seo7', 's7', 'e0vZ9cxdilo'),
(99, 'seo7', 's8', 'W99pMUr6G8Q'),
(100, 'seo8', 's1', 'On hold voice - IVR &amp; Phone prompts | Guy Harris'),
(101, 'seo8', 's2', 'On hold voice - UK based, British voiceover Guy Harris is the voice of many IVR and phone prompts around the UK. A credible English voice for yours?'),
(102, 'seo8', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;Thanks for calling your &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;new on-hold voice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Every week I become the on hold voice of dozens of new companies. A friendly and sincere voice for your brand?&lt;br&gt;\r\nYour IVR should have a credible voice and one with experience. Thats exactly what you will get.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(103, 'seo8', 's4', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Please &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;hold&lt;/span&gt; the line&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;On hold marketing can be a massive benefit to a company&#039;s telephone system. The importance of promoting your product or brand to your callers while on hold should not be underestimated. &lt;br&gt;\r\nOn average callers to a business spend 33 seconds waiting to be connected. So, imagine what you could say to your callers during the time they are on hold or being transferred.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(104, 'seo8', 's5', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Your call is  &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;important &lt;/span&gt;to us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;I work with the UK&#039;s biggest on hold companies daily and become the voice of dozens of new companies every week.&lt;br&gt;\r\nWith a clear and concise delivery, promote your marketing message to callers while on hold or being connected.&lt;br&gt;\r\nKeeping the scripts short will have more impact.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(105, 'seo8', 's6', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;We&#039;ll be with you &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;in a moment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Phone prompts are actually very affordable. Starting at just &pound;5 per short prompt. (minimum order fee applies)&lt;br&gt;\r\nWhy not enhance your companies on hold messaging? Take the opportunity to highlight your latest promotion, let them know of events you will be hosting or attending or just wish your callers Merry Christmas and Happy New Year.&lt;br&gt;\r\nWhat ever you decide to promote, do it with a voice of experience. &lt;br&gt;\r\nCall or email your enquiry and ideas by &lt;a href=&quot;contact-guy&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Click to get in touch&quot;&gt;Getting in touch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(106, 'seo8', 's7', 'TKdzDAb9MIA'),
(107, 'seo8', 's8', 'TqkdBK8mBW8'),
(108, 'seo9', 's1', 'Voiceover Imaging &ndash; Radio Station Branding'),
(109, 'seo9', 's2', 'Need voiceover imaging? Guy Harris delivers high-energy station branding for radio, DJ drops, podcast intros and broadcast imaging with lightning turnaround.'),
(110, 'seo9', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;Voiceover &lt;span  class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;imaging&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;I provide voiceover Imaging and sponsorship voices to the award winning UKRD Group and BBC Radio 1 &amp; 2.&lt;br&gt;\r\nOther stations and brands around the globe that use my voice include GB News &amp; Fun Kids.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(111, 'seo9', 's4', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Availability&lt;/span&gt; is key&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Radio stations choose imaging voices on their voices, flexibility and availability. Many have constantly changing promotions and client sponsorships, so being available is key to success&lt;br&gt;\r\nI work a lot with station sound at the BBC and provide imaging pieces for Radio 1 &amp; 2.&lt;br&gt;\r\nCheck out the imaging and show intros for &lt;a href=&quot;https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/bbc-radio-1-big-weekend&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;The Big Weekend.&quot;&gt;The Big Weekend.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;'),
(112, 'seo9', 's5', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Fun Kids&lt;/span&gt; Radio&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Adjusting to different times zones is essential too. All of which is not a problem when working with a full time voiceover.&lt;br&gt;\r\nI&#039;m the station imaging voice for Fun Kids, the UK&#039;s radio station for kids, families and parents. Listen on DAB Digital Radio nationwide, online and mobile.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(113, 'seo9', 's6', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Radio&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt; Imaging&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Radio imaging is the general term for the composite effect of multiple and varied on-air sound effects that identify, brand and market a particular radio station. These sound effects include: voiceover, music beds, sweepers, intros, promos, liners, stingers, bumpers, and jingles.&lt;br&gt;\r\nFor your Imaging Voice, &lt;a href=&quot;contact-guy&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Get in Touch&quot;&gt;get in touch.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;'),
(114, 'seo9', 's7', 'Z4oP6c1ebjI/edit'),
(115, 'seo9', 's8', '6zOVX7VeH2Y'),
(116, 'seo10', 's1', 'Movie Trailer Voice - In a World - Imaging &amp; Trailers'),
(117, 'seo10', 's2', 'Need a Movie Trailer Voice? Guy Harris - The Movie Trailer VoiceoverGuy | Voiceoverguy.co.uk or movietrailervoice.co.uk for Movie Trailer Voice Cuts.'),
(118, 'seo10', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;The &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Movie Trailer&lt;/span&gt; voice&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;My Movie Trailer Voice is heard worldwide on TV &amp; Radio including BBC Sport, BBC Radio 1 and many Game Trailers.&lt;br&gt;\r\nThe style has been around for years. That deep epic voice made famous by the late great Don La Fontaine and Hal Douglas.&lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(119, 'seo10', 's4', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;In a World&hellip; One Man...&lt;/span&gt; One Voice&hellip;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;My movie voice is regularly used on radio commercials and Movie Trailers on YouTube and the small screen too across the world.&lt;br&gt;\r\nThe Big Trailer Voice that makes you wanna watch that film or&hellip; buy YOUR Product! &lt;br&gt;\r\nDespite being British I can give you an American and English Movie Trailer Voice. Let me know what you prefer and if it helps, send me some lines and I&#039;ll send you a custom sample first. So we know I&#039;m the right voice for the project.&lt;br&gt;\r\nLet me enhance your production, film or event. &lt;br&gt;\r\nGet in touch below and tell me more!&lt;/p&gt;'),
(120, 'seo10', 's5', '18oOI8mHZzs'),
(121, 'seo10', 's6', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;How to order your &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Movie Trailer Voice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Movie Trailer Voice became so popular I set up &lt;a class=&quot;ident&quot; title=&quot;Movie Trailer Voice Guy&quot; href=&quot;http://movietrailervoice.co.uk/home/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;The Movie Trailer Voice Cuts&lt;/a&gt; website allowing you to purchase a stack of mp3 Movie Trailer Voice Cliches. &lt;br&gt;\r\nMovie voice cuts in high quality you can use on personal productions. Simply drag the files onto your timeline and start editing. Works great in Final Cut ProX, Adobe Premier and many other video editors.&lt;br&gt;\r\nFor commercial use and bespoke lines for your project&lt;br&gt;please visit &lt;a href=&quot;contact-guy&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;The Movie Trailer Voice - Book here&quot;&gt;the contact us page&lt;/a&gt; and tell us more. Please give as much detail as you can including usage and script length. This allows for a more accurate quote quickly.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(122, 'seo10', 's7', 'Cncd3VgDQ9s'),
(123, 'seo10', 's8', 'embrh2Y5VjI'),
(124, 'seo10', 's9', 'bcCpLnX-1ck'),
(125, 'seo11', 's1', 'Character Voiceover &ndash; Voice Creation by Guy Harris'),
(126, 'seo11', 's2', 'Character voiceovers by Guy Harris. Looking for a unique character voice style? As heard on apps and games. A plethora of character styles to listen to'),
(127, 'seo11', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;A page of &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt; Character voiceover&lt;/span&gt; showreels&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;My character voiceovers are heard on TV, Radio, Apps, Games &amp; Virals worldwide daily. &lt;br&gt;\r\n&ldquo;I hear voices in my head&rdquo; that&#039;s me on a daily basis. So if you have a script and project, let me unleash them! &lt;/p&gt;'),
(128, 'seo11', 's4', '&lt;h1&gt;The UK&#039;s Most Versatile &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Character Voiceover&lt;/span&gt; Artist&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Across TV, radio, games, apps and animation, my character voices pop up everywhere. From heroic narrators to unhinged goblins, \r\nand from blockbuster game villains to silly cartoon sidekicks &mdash; I lend my voice to worlds big and small. \r\nIf you&rsquo;ve got a script bursting with personality, I can bring it to life.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;!-- Mini Player Character Voice --&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;margin:20px 0;&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;audio controls style=&quot;width:100%; max-width:420px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;source src=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/audio/guy-harris-voiceoverguy-character-showreel.mp3&quot; type=&quot;audio/mpeg&quot;&gt;\r\n    Your browser does not support the audio element.\r\n  &lt;/audio&gt;\r\n  &lt;p style=&quot;font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    Character Voice Showreel &ndash; Guy Harris\r\n  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve created iconic character voices for &lt;a href=&quot;/boom-beach-hammerman-voice&quot; title=&quot;Boom Beach Hammerman Voiceover&quot;&gt;Boom Beach&lt;/a&gt;, \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;/minecraft-combat-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Minecraft Character Voice&quot;&gt;Minecraft&lt;/a&gt;, \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;/clash-of-clans-goblins-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Clash of Clans Goblin Voice&quot;&gt;Clash of Clans&lt;/a&gt;, \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;/thomas-the-tank-engine-voice-of-salty&quot; title=&quot;Salty Thomas &amp; Friends&quot;&gt;Thomas &amp; Friends&lt;/a&gt;, \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;/joker-voice&quot; title=&quot;Joker Voiceover&quot;&gt;The Joker&lt;/a&gt;, \r\nand even &lt;a href=&quot;/playmobil-pirate-voice&quot; title=&quot;Pirate Voiceover&quot;&gt;singing pirates&lt;/a&gt;.  \r\nIf it&rsquo;s wild, wacky or wonderfully weird &mdash; I&rsquo;m your guy.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(129, 'seo11', 's5', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Crazy Voice Guy&lt;/span&gt; | Unique Voices for Unique Characters&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hi there &mdash; I&rsquo;m the Crazy Voice Guy. Whether you need a gangsta raccoon, a hopelessly romantic robot, a grumpy wizard,\r\na lovable dog, or a full-on cartoon lunatic, I&rsquo;m always up for creating something new. Character work is where I get to play,\r\nexperiment and throw everything at the wall until the perfect voice appears.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Want to hear some more? This showreel features gaming voices, silly accents, singing characters and some truly daft creations.\r\nIf you need a voice with personality (or several personalities), let&rsquo;s chat.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;For more examples, check out:\r\n&lt;br&gt;&bull; &lt;a href=&quot;/super-hero-voice&quot; title=&quot;Super Hero Voice&quot;&gt;Super Hero Voice&lt;/a&gt;\r\n&lt;br&gt;&bull; &lt;a href=&quot;/seabrooks-in-for-a-penny-sponsor-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Crazy Seabrooks Penny Voice&quot;&gt;Seabrooks &ldquo;In For a Penny&rdquo;&lt;/a&gt;\r\n&lt;br&gt;&bull; &lt;a href=&quot;/scary-movie-ghost-face-voice&quot; title=&quot;Ghost Face Voice&quot;&gt;Ghost Face Voice&lt;/a&gt;\r\n&lt;br&gt;&bull; &lt;a href=&quot;/pantomime-dame-voice&quot; title=&quot;Panto Dame Voice&quot;&gt;Pantomime Dame Voice&lt;/a&gt;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(130, 'seo11', 's6', '&lt;h2&gt;Let&rsquo;s &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Work Together&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Got a script ready? Or maybe you&rsquo;ve just got a rough idea and need help shaping it? No problem. I can direct your session live via \r\nCleanfeed, Zoom or Teams, helping you fine-tune pacing, personality and performance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Whether it&rsquo;s a &lt;a href=&quot;/masked-singer-voice-of-god-butlins&quot; title=&quot;Voice of God&quot;&gt;big booming announcer&lt;/a&gt;, \r\na &lt;a href=&quot;/pathe-news-jack-fm&quot; title=&quot;Pathe Voice&quot;&gt;retro Pathe News narrator&lt;/a&gt;, \r\na &lt;a href=&quot;/craig-cash-gogglebox-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Craig Cash Voice&quot;&gt;Craig Cash-style Gogglebox character&lt;/a&gt;,\r\nor a &lt;a href=&quot;/star-wars-character-voices&quot; title=&quot;Star Wars Voice&quot;&gt;Star Wars creature voice&lt;/a&gt;,\r\nI&rsquo;m ready to help bring your character to life.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you&rsquo;ve got a YouTube clip or reference voice you want me to start from, even better. \r\nReady to turn your character into something unforgettable? \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;/contact-guy&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Contact Guy Harris&quot;&gt;Get in touch&lt;/a&gt; today.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(131, 'seo11', 's7', 'Ad85PPvSfbc'),
(132, 'seo11', 's8', 'k7DZFWnOcvo'),
(133, 'seo12', 's1', 'Santa Voice - The UK&#039;s Voice of Santa by Guy Harris'),
(134, 'seo12', 's2', 'The UK&#039;s busiest voice of Santa, heard worldwide at Christmas on BBC Radio 2, ITV, Santa Radio, Heart, Heart Xmas, Boom Radio, CBeebies, Centre Parcs and more.'),
(135, 'seo12', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;The UK&rsquo;s Leading &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Voice of Santa&lt;/span&gt; &ndash; Ho Ho Ho!&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nAs the UK&rsquo;s most in-demand Santa Claus voice &mdash; heard on BBC Radio 2, Capital, ITV, Heart Xmas and Santa Radio &mdash; \r\nI bring festive magic to brands large and small. From national Christmas campaigns to heartfelt messages and \r\nfamily-friendly promotions, this is the warm, iconic Father Christmas voice trusted across the UK every year.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(136, 'seo12', 's4', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;The Voice That Defines Christmas&lt;/span&gt; Across the UK&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nFrom my &lt;a href=&quot;/bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;BBC Radio 2&quot;&gt;BBC Radio 2&lt;/a&gt; \r\nwork with Zoe Ball to Christmas Day catch-ups on Capital, Santa on \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;/this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;ITV&quot;&gt;ITV&rsquo;s This Morning&lt;/a&gt;, \r\nand the GO Jetters on CBeebies &mdash; my Santa voice is heard nationwide every December.\r\n&lt;br&gt;\r\nWith years of experience bringing Father Christmas to life, my voice has become one of the UK&rsquo;s definitive \r\nsounds of Christmas. Authentic, warm, joyful, and instantly recognisable &mdash; no imitations here. Just the real, \r\nBritish Father Christmas voice trusted by major brands every year.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n&lt;!-- Mini Player Santa Voice --&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;margin:20px 0;&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;audio controls style=&quot;width:100%; max-width:420px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;source src=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/audio/santa-voice-showreel-2025-guy-harris.mp3&quot; type=&quot;audio/mpeg&quot;&gt;\r\n    Your browser does not support the audio element.\r\n  &lt;/audio&gt;\r\n  &lt;p style=&quot;font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    Father Christmas &amp; Santa Voice Showreel &ndash; Guy Harris\r\n  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;'),
(137, 'seo12', 's5', '&lt;h2&gt;Enjoy &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Santa&rsquo;s Free Apps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nWhy not download some of my free Christmas apps?  \r\nGreat for kids and families. Check out \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/santa-radio/id1021183593&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; \r\n   title=&quot;Santa Radio&quot;&gt;Santa Radio&lt;/a&gt;, \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/santa-text/id1024535991&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; \r\n   title=&quot;Santa Text&quot;&gt;Santa Text&lt;/a&gt;, \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/santa-messages/id1062532143&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; \r\n   title=&quot;Santa Messages&quot;&gt;Santa Messages&lt;/a&gt;, and \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/sleeps-to-santa/id949843943&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; \r\n   title=&quot;Sleeps til Santa&quot;&gt;Sleeps til Santa&lt;/a&gt;.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nOr try the App Store&rsquo;s No.1 \r\n&lt;a class=&quot;ident&quot; href=&quot;https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/santa-voicemail/id586387813&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; \r\n   title=&quot;Santa Voicemail App&quot;&gt;Santa Voicemail App&lt;/a&gt; &mdash; letting children call Santa direct from his workshop.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nFancy a personalised message?  \r\nTry my &lt;a href=&quot;/santa-script-generator&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Santa Script Generator&quot;&gt;Santa Script Generator&lt;/a&gt;, \r\nor the hilarious \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;/poundland-self-service-till-santa-voice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;\r\n   title=&quot;FREE Personalised Santa Message&quot;&gt;Poundland Santa Till Voice&lt;/a&gt;.\r\n&lt;br&gt;\r\nOr upgrade to a \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://festivestudio.com/i/santaradio/personalised-video&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; \r\n   title=&quot;Personalised Santa Video&quot;&gt;Personalised Santa Video&lt;/a&gt;.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(138, 'seo12', 's6', '&lt;h2&gt;Santa Radio &ndash; &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;In the Air&lt;/span&gt; &amp; &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;On the Air&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nSanta Radio broadcasts 365 days a year direct from Santa&rsquo;s workshop &mdash; the UK&rsquo;s No.1 online \r\n&lt;strong&gt;Christmas radio station&lt;/strong&gt;, packed with festive hits, brand-new releases and classic favourites.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nHosted by &lt;a href=&quot;/the-official-voice-of-santa&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; \r\n   title=&quot;Guy Harris &ndash; The Official Voice of Santa&quot;&gt;Guy Harris&lt;/a&gt;, \r\nthe station brings festive fun, humour and heart-warming moments all year round.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nEnjoy featured shows, celebrity guests and explore our \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.santaradio.co.uk/mugshots/all&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; \r\n   title=&quot;Celebrity Santa Radio Mug Shots&quot;&gt;MUG SHOTS&lt;/a&gt; &mdash; packed with famous faces spreading festive cheer.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nListen anywhere &mdash; on iOS, Apple TV, Amazon devices, TuneIn and more via \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.santaradio.co.uk&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Santa Radio&quot;&gt;SantaRadio.co.uk&lt;/a&gt;.  \r\nFollow along for instant streaming.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nWant something fun?  \r\nTry my &lt;a href=&quot;/santa-script-generator&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Santa Script Generator&quot;&gt;Santa Script Generator&lt;/a&gt;,  \r\nor enjoy the hilarious \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/poundland-self-service-till-santa-voice&quot; title=&quot;Poundland Santa Voice&quot;&gt;\r\nPoundland Santa Till Voice&lt;/a&gt;.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;centre&quot;&gt;\r\nWant more?  \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.santaradio.co.uk&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Listen Live on Santa Radio&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;strong&gt;Listen Live on Santa Radio &ndash; The World&rsquo;s Best Christmas Station&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(139, 'seo12', 's7', 'P44bGiUI0vE'),
(140, 'seo12', 's8', 'yi-4Fm40nmE'),
(141, 'seo13', 's1', 'Football Commentator Voice - Guy Harris - authentic'),
(142, 'seo13', 's2', 'UK&#039;s Leading Football Commentator Voiceover &ndash; Elevate your adverts, promos, &amp; games with authentic commentary. As heard on ITV, Netflix, Pizza Hut, and Man City'),
(143, 'seo13', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;The UK&rsquo;s Leading &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Football Commentator&lt;/span&gt; Voice&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Looking for a high-energy, big-match commentator voice? Whether it&rsquo;s a spoof sports promo, a comedy sketch, a stadium-style TV trailer or a high-pressure brand campaign, I deliver that unmistakable football excitement on cue.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;My commentary work has featured across major broadcasters and global brands &mdash; from &lt;strong&gt;BBC Radio 1&lt;/strong&gt; to &lt;strong&gt;Netflix&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;qatar-drone-race-psg-voiceover&quot;&gt;Paris Saint-Germain&rsquo;s Qatar Drone Race&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice&quot;&gt;Just Eat UEFA promos&lt;/a&gt;, and national ad campaigns. If you want the drama, the urgency, and the iconic British tone &mdash; you&rsquo;re in the right place.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(144, 'seo13', 's4', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Seamless Technology Meets Authentic Commentary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;With experience voicing for &lt;a href=&quot;iboy-football-commentator&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Netflix voiceover&quot;&gt;Netflix&lt;/a&gt;&#039;s iBoy, major brands like &lt;a href=&quot;pizza-hut-delivery-football-commentator-voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&#039;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Pizza Hut football commentary&quot;&gt;Pizza Hut&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;manchester-city-football-commentry-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Man City&quot;&gt;Man City&lt;/a&gt;, my voice adds the final touch of drama to your campaign. I can take direction via Source Connect, Cleanfeed or Zoom to get the perfect take remotely, fast.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you like this style, you might also enjoy my &lt;a href=&quot;movie-trailer-voice&quot; title=&quot;Movie Trailer Voice&quot;&gt;Movie Trailer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;gameshow-host&quot; title=&quot;Gameshow Host Voice&quot;&gt;Gameshow Host&lt;/a&gt; or even my &lt;a href=&quot;voice-of-god&quot; title=&quot;Voice of God&quot;&gt;Voice of God&lt;/a&gt; reads - all delivered from my broadcast-quality studio.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(145, 'seo13', 's5', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Two Decades of Voiceover Excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For over 20 years, I&rsquo;ve delivered football-style voiceovers worldwide. I&rsquo;ve voiced major campaigns including &lt;a href=&quot;etisalat-celebrating-victory-football-commentator-voice&quot;&gt;Etisalat&rsquo;s &ldquo;Celebrating Victory&rdquo;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;betfred-football-commentator&quot;&gt;Betfred&lt;/a&gt;, bringing big-match energy to scripted and improvised reads.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;I provide broadcast audio, fast delivery and reliable direction-friendly sessions. Intensity, comic timing or full commentator chaos? I&rsquo;ve the versatility and experience to hit the brief.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;From one-liners to full campaign coverage, you get consistency, clarity and that instantly recognisable football commentator sound.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(146, 'seo13', 's6', '&lt;h2&gt;Trusted by Premier Brands&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;My voice has featured in global ads, radio promos, sketches, digital campaigns and even stadium content. Whatever the brief &mdash; drama, parody or full-tilt excitement &mdash; I bring the energy and authenticity clients rely on.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;You&rsquo;ll also find me voicing &lt;a href=&quot;santa-voice&quot;&gt;Santa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;david-attenborough-voice&quot;&gt;David Attenborough-style narration&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;pathe-news-voice&quot;&gt;Path&eacute; News&lt;/a&gt; reads, giving brands a full spectrum of character and documentary styles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;contact-guy&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot;&gt;Get in touch&lt;/a&gt; to book a session or request a quote for your next project.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(147, 'seo13', 's7', 'T9opwMc46Ms'),
(148, 'seo13', 's8', '1wYjSxN9mJI'),
(149, 'seo14', 's1', 'Pirate Voice - Authentic Swashbuckling | Guy Harris'),
(150, 'seo14', 's2', 'UK&#039;s Top Pirate Voiceover Artist &ndash; Ahoy! Book Guy for authentic pirate voices, as heard in LEGO trailers, BBC, and more. Get your treasure of a quote today!'),
(151, 'seo14', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;The Go-To Pirate Voiceover Artist As Featured on CBBC&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ahoy! In search of an authentic pirate voiceover? Look no further! Guy&rsquo;s inspiration is drawn from iconic characters like Captain Barbossa from Disney&#039;s Pirates of the Caribbean films. You can either listen to his captivating pirate showreel or watch it in action.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;From voicing characters on &lt;a href=&quot;/cbbc-pirate-week-voice&quot; title=&quot;CBBC Pirate Week Voice&quot;&gt;CBBC Pirate Week&lt;/a&gt; to being the vocal force behind Pirate Bridge, Guy has a track record that not only impresses but ensures he never has to walk the plank! Get in touch to secure Guy&rsquo;s voice for your next swashbuckling adventure.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(152, 'seo14', 's4', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Voice of a &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Pirate&lt;/span&gt; on CBBC&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Yarr! You be looking for an authentic Pirate Voiceover?&lt;br&gt;\r\nInspiration taken from Captain Barbossa of the Disney Pirates of the Caribbean Movies.&lt;br&gt;\r\nListen to the Pirate showreel or watch it in action.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;You may also recognise Guy from roles such as the \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;/pop-up-pirate-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Pop-Up Pirate Voiceover&quot;&gt;Pop-Up Pirate voice&lt;/a&gt; \r\nand the swashbuckling star of \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;/playmobil-pirate-voice&quot; title=&quot;Playmobil Pirate Voice&quot;&gt;Playmobil Pirate World&lt;/a&gt;. \r\nFrom children&rsquo;s TV to toy commercials, his pirate performances truly bring the seven seas to life.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;A CBBC Pirate or the voice of Pirate Bridge &mdash; the director was so happy Guy didn&rsquo;t have to walk the plank!&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;!-- Mini Pirate Player --&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;margin:20px 0;&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;audio controls style=&quot;width:100%; max-width:420px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;source src=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/audio/pirate-showreel-guy-harris.mp3&quot; type=&quot;audio/mpeg&quot;&gt;\r\n    Your browser does not support the audio element.\r\n  &lt;/audio&gt;\r\n  &lt;p style=&quot;font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    Pirate Voice Showreel &ndash; Guy Harris\r\n  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;'),
(153, 'seo14', 's5', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Authentic Pirate VoiceOver Talent&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guy isn&rsquo;t just any voice actor; he&rsquo;s the resonant force behind the Pirate World Trailer for Lego MiniFigures and the in-game pirate captain. When it comes to crafting an authentic pirate narrative, Guy is your go-to talent. Check out his work on \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;/lego-minifigures-pirate&quot; title=&quot;LEGO Minifigures Pirate Voice&quot;&gt;LEGO Minifigures Pirate&lt;/a&gt; \r\nfor a taste of his character range.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Clients have the flexibility to direct sessions in real-time via Source Connect, Cleanfeed, or Zoom, ensuring the perfect take.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;As a special bonus, we&rsquo;ll even throw in parrot squawks!&lt;/p&gt;'),
(154, 'seo14', 's6', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Need a Pirate Voice Actor? Your Search Ends Here.&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guy is one of the busiest voices and when it comes to needing the sound or style of a Pirate voice actor then your search ends here. That rasp, that growl and of course the ah ha ha ha&hellip; Guy is among the industry&#039;s most sought-after pirate talents, specialising in authentic pirate narration. Explore more of his roles through \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;/pirate-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Pirate Voiceover&quot;&gt;Pirate Voiceover&lt;/a&gt;, \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;/playmobil-pirate-voice&quot; title=&quot;Playmobil Pirate Voice&quot;&gt;Playmobil Pirate Voice&lt;/a&gt;, \r\nand CBBC&rsquo;s swashbuckling \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;/cbbc-pirate-week-voice&quot; title=&quot;CBBC Pirate Voice&quot;&gt;Pirate Week&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;To get started, we&rsquo;d like to know a few specifics about your project. Information such as intended usage and word count will help us provide you with an accurate quote. Rest assured, our rates are highly competitive in GBP, making top-quality pirate VoiceOver both accessible and affordable.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ready to bring your vision to life with unparalleled pirate flair? \r\n&lt;a href=&quot;contact-guy&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Contact a Pirate&quot;&gt;Contact us today&lt;/a&gt;.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(155, 'seo14', 's7', 'Egnp8ZWrojI'),
(156, 'seo14', 's8', 'JgMjQ2lo9oo'),
(157, 'seo15', 's1', 'Gameshow Host voice heard on TV &amp; Radio - Guy Harris'),
(158, 'seo15', 's2', 'That Gameshow Host Voice as heard on TV, Radio and for Guinness World Records - UK &amp; USA Gameshow Host styles by Voiceover Guy Harris'),
(159, 'seo15', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;Now time for the... &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Gameshow&lt;/span&gt; voice!&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Looking for that over the top Gameshow Host voice? Got an event that needs some cheese?&lt;br&gt;\r\nGuy delivers both a great UK and USA version of this cheesy style.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(160, 'seo15', 's4', '&lt;h2&gt;THIS MORNING &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Spin to Win Gameshow&lt;/span&gt; voice&lt;h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guy is heard frequently on ITV&#039;s flagship mid morning magazine show with Phil and Holly. The voice of the huge prizes when the celebrities are not voicing them.&lt;br&gt;\r\nThen comes Spin to Win! Guy,  you got a gameshow voice? Err, Yeah!&lt;br&gt;This is where Phil and Holly spin the wheel and should it land on a holiday, thats when you&#039;ll hear that cheesy Gameshow Voice style.\r\n&lt;p&gt;Some of the other exciting projects included an American gameshow voice promo on BBC Radio 1 for &lt;a  class=&quot;ident&quot; title=&quot;Headcam Day Promo - BBC Radio 1&quot; href=&quot;https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/gameshow-usa&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Headcam day&lt;/a&gt; too.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(161, 'seo15', 's5', '&lt;h2&gt;Need a Robot &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Gameshow&lt;/span&gt; voice?&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;On a trip to Hollywood we visited the Guinness Book of Records Museum, and heard my voice on the Robot in the new Trivia Quiz attraction.&lt;br&gt;\r\nIf you ever find yourself on Hollywood Blvd, do pop in and play.&lt;br&gt;\r\nThere is never a dull moment in voiceover and it&#039;s always exciting to see what job enquiries come in. I have to say, the Quiz Show Host Voice is one of my favourites.&lt;br&gt;\r\nSo, if you want that Cheesy Game Show Voice, do get in touch.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(162, 'seo15', 's6', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Time for a &lt;/span&gt;Quiz&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Question 1. How do you get your Gameshow Host voice?&lt;br&gt;\r\nQuestion 2. Will it cost a lot of money?&lt;br&gt;\r\nQuestion 3. How long will it take?&lt;br&gt;\r\nAnswers. &lt;p&gt;\r\n1 Get in touch. \r\n&lt;br&gt;2 Probably not.\r\n&lt;br&gt;3 A same day service.&lt;br&gt;\r\nLet me bring your quiz to life. Let me enhance a corporate event with a quiz show voice that will rouse a smile or 2.&lt;br&gt;\r\nClick &lt;a href=&quot;contact-guy&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;the contact page&quot;&gt;the contact page&lt;/a&gt; to get in touch.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(163, 'seo15', 's7', 'lMgRXetDlKU'),
(164, 'seo15', 's8', 'B3FiqvXTeX8'),
(165, 'seo16', 's1', 'Pathe News Voice - 1940&rsquo;s &amp; 1950&#039;s Danvers-Walker style'),
(166, 'seo16', 's2', 'Pathe News Voice - This is my 1940&rsquo;s &amp; 1950&#039;s retro voiceover style heard on radio ads and productions including BBC Radio 1, Everton FC and Horlicks.'),
(167, 'seo16', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;Capture the Vintage Vibes with a Genuine &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Pathe News&lt;/span&gt; voice&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Embark on a nostalgic journey with the voice style that dominated British newsreels from the 1940s to the 1960s. &lt;br&gt;Perfect for lending a classic, retro touch to your project, my Pathe News voice captures the essence of this iconic era. &quot;Attention, all listeners! Don&#039;t dilly-dally&mdash;book your project today!&quot;&lt;/p&gt;'),
(168, 'seo16', 's4', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Relive the Golden Age with &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Horlicks&lt;/span&gt; : A Case Study&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;When Horlicks, the esteemed nutritional malt milk drink brand, aimed to narrate its rich history, only a genuine Pathe News voice could do justice. My work with Horlicks was not just a voiceover&mdash;it was a time machine. Interested in similar storytelling for your brand? Let&#039;s have a chin-wag!\r\n&lt;br&gt;I voice a lot of scripts as the voice of Pathe News, Including these for &lt;a href=&quot;pathe-news-jack-fm&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Radio station Jack FM&quot;&gt;Radio station Jack FM&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(169, 'seo16', 's5', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Pitch Perfect for &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Everton FC&lt;/span&gt; : A Voice That Scores Goals&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;When Everton Football Club sought a voice reminiscent of Harry Enfield&#039;s Cholmondeley Warner character, I was their go-to guy. I enjoyed adding vintage charm to a modern-day video presentation, connecting the fans with the players in a unique way. Need something similar? I&#039;m just a chat away.&lt;br&gt;Why not check out my dedicated &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pathevoice.co.uk&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Path&eacute; News Voiceover&quot;&gt;Path&eacute; News Voiceover&lt;/a&gt; Website\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(170, 'seo16', 's6', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The History of &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;British Path&eacute;&lt;/span&gt; : A Legacy of Voices&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;As a pioneer in the film industry, Charles Path&eacute; shaped a century of British history through newsreels, cinemagazines, and documentaries. Today, the &lt;a class=&quot;ident&quot; href=&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pathe_News&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;The Path&eacute; News archiveo&quot;&gt;The Path&eacute; News archive&lt;/a&gt; serves as a digital time capsule, including the iconic voice of &lt;a href=&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bob_Danvers-Walker&quot; target= &quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Bob Danvers-Walker.&quot;&gt;Bob Danvers-Walker.&lt;/a&gt; Looking to add that vintage allure to your project? Then look no further.\r\n&lt;br&gt;With extensive experience in this highly requested style, your project will benefit from my professional, broadcast-quality voiceover service. So don&#039;t keep calm&mdash;&lt;a href=&quot;contact-guy&quot; title=&quot;Contact Guy Harris for Pathe News style voice&quot;&gt;contact me&lt;/a&gt; right away for a chat about your next vintage-themed project!&lt;/p&gt;'),
(171, 'seo16', 's7', 'Hp8-la1KL6E'),
(172, 'seo16', 's8', 'ArEJtd9c6Uw'),
(173, 'seo17', 's1', 'Halloween Voice - Guy Harris - The Spooky Voiceover Guy'),
(174, 'seo17', 's2', 'UK&rsquo;s Premier Halloween Voiceover &ndash; Guy Harris is the trusted male voice for Fright Nights, Alton Towers, Ghost Face, Dracula &amp; more. Spooky, fun, fast delivery.'),
(175, 'seo17', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;A Halloween voice over to &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;scare&lt;/span&gt; you&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Need a spooky Halloween voiceover for your production? Get your show, podcast, promos and radio imaging ready for Halloween with a fast, fun delivery. I&rsquo;m the voice of Ghost Face, Dracula, The Director at Alton Towers Scarefest, and The Spooky Voice of Heart.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;And if you need something darker, check out my &lt;a class=&quot;ident&quot; title=&quot;Joker Voice&quot; href=&quot;joker-voice&quot;&gt;Joker Voice&lt;/a&gt; &mdash; made famous in The Dark Knight by Heath Ledger.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(176, 'seo17', 's4', '&lt;h2&gt;The Premier Halloween Voice Actor in the UK&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;From Thorpe Park&rsquo;s legendary &lt;a href=&quot;https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/frightnights&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Fright Nights&quot;&gt;Fright Nights&lt;/a&gt; to Alton Towers&rsquo; Scarefest, I&rsquo;m one of the UK&rsquo;s go-to voices for all things Halloween. Whether you need eerie narration, a sinister villain, or full Vincent Price-style drama, I&rsquo;ve voiced it.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;I specialise in chilling, atmospheric reads &mdash; from &lt;a href=&quot;/evil-character-voiceover&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Pure EVIL&quot;&gt;PURE EVIL&lt;/a&gt; to comedic spooky characters like &lt;a href=&quot;/spooky-halloween-laughs&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Spooky Halloween Laughs&quot;&gt;Spooky Halloween Laughs&lt;/a&gt;. My Halloween range covers promos, radio ads, trailers, and theme park events across the UK.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;!-- Mini Player Halloween --&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;margin:20px 0;&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;audio controls style=&quot;width:100%; max-width:420px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;source src=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/audio/guy-harris-voiceoverguy-halloween-showreel.mp3&quot; type=&quot;audio/mpeg&quot;&gt;\r\n    Your browser does not support the audio element.\r\n  &lt;/audio&gt;\r\n  &lt;p style=&quot;font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    Spooky Halloween Voice Showreel &ndash; Guy Harris\r\n  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;'),
(177, 'seo17', 's5', '&lt;h2&gt;Mastering Iconic Voices: The Joker from &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;The Dark Knight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Regarded as one of cinema&rsquo;s greatest villains, Heath Ledger&rsquo;s Joker is a voice every impressionist knows &mdash; and few can get right. I&rsquo;ve honed this unsettling sound-alike for trailers, horror promos and Halloween creatives. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;If your project needs something dark, chaotic and unmistakably Joker, check out the YouTube demo and get in touch.&lt;/p&gt;');
INSERT INTO `options` (`id`, `group`, `item`, `value`) VALUES
(178, 'seo17', 's6', '&lt;h2&gt;Fast, High-Quality Spooky Voiceovers from a State-of-the-Art Studio&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;When time matters, most Halloween scripts are voiced the same day &mdash; all from my broadcast-quality studio. For pricing, just send your script and usage details and I&rsquo;ll respond quickly.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;From &lt;a href=&quot;/scary-movie-ghost-face-voice&quot; title=&quot;Ghost Face Voice&quot;&gt;Ghost Face&lt;/a&gt; to &lt;a href=&quot;/dracula-voiceover-for-halloween&quot; title=&quot;Dracula Voice&quot;&gt;Dracula&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;/joker-voice&quot; title=&quot;Joker Voice&quot;&gt;Joker&lt;/a&gt;, and even &lt;a href=&quot;/wilhelm-scream-shreek-shout-sfx-voiceover-film&quot; title=&quot;Wilhelm Scream SFX&quot;&gt;Wilhelm Scream-style effects&lt;/a&gt;, my Halloween range covers everything from evil characters to tongue-in-cheek spooky reads.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;As one of the UK&rsquo;s most in-demand &lt;a href=&quot;/voiceoverguy&quot; title=&quot;British Male Voiceover Artist&quot;&gt;male Halloween voiceover artists&lt;/a&gt;, I also voice &lt;a href=&quot;/commercial-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Commercial Voiceover&quot;&gt;commercials&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;/game-trailer-voice&quot; title=&quot;Game Trailer Voice&quot;&gt;game trailers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;/voiceover-cartoons&quot; title=&quot;Cartoon Voiceovers&quot;&gt;cartoons&lt;/a&gt; and theme park announcements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Need it urgently?&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;/contact-guy&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Contact Guy Harris&quot;&gt;Get in touch&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(179, 'seo17', 's7', 'bmMpk16zuSs'),
(180, 'seo17', 's8', 'OMlBk5QBnyM'),
(181, 'seo18', 's1', 'David Attenborough Voice Impression - Guy Harris'),
(182, 'seo18', 's2', 'David Attenborough impression voiceover &ndash; A flawless, respectful sound-a-like of Sir David for TV, games, and documentaries. Listen now and get a quick quote.'),
(183, 'seo18', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;The UK&rsquo;s Leading David Attenborough Voiceover Artist &ndash; Heard Worldwide&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Looking for a realistic &lt;strong&gt;David Attenborough voiceover&lt;/strong&gt;? You&rsquo;ve found it. Recognised as one of the UK&rsquo;s most trusted &lt;strong&gt;Attenborough sound-a-likes&lt;/strong&gt;, my impression has been heard across TV, radio, games, trailers, and viral campaigns. Always delivered with respect, humour, and the detail clients expect.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(184, 'seo18', 's4', '&lt;h2&gt;Where You&rsquo;ve Heard My Attenborough Voice&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;My &lt;strong&gt;David Attenborough impression&lt;/strong&gt; has been heard on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/turkish-bird-attenborough-voice&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Social Media Attenborough style&quot;&gt;social media campaigns&lt;/a&gt;, the viral &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-impression&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; title=&quot;Biffa Attenborough video&quot;&gt;Biffa video&lt;/a&gt;, and across &lt;strong&gt;video games&lt;/strong&gt; including &lt;a href=&quot;horizon-zero-dawn-voice&quot; title=&quot;David Attenborough impersonation Video Game demo&quot;&gt;Horizon Zero Dawn&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Projects like &lt;a href=&quot;cracking-ice-david-attenborough-impression&quot; title=&quot;Cracking Ice Attenborough Voice&quot;&gt;Cracking Ice&lt;/a&gt;, a tongue-in-cheek parody of nature docs, or the &lt;a href=&quot;natural-instincts-trailer-attenborough-voice&quot; title=&quot;Natural Instincts Trailer Attenborough Voice&quot;&gt;Natural Instincts trailer&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;From commercials and trailers to &lt;a href=&quot;character-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;Character Voiceovers&quot;&gt;character voiceover work&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;voiceover-cartoons&quot; title=&quot;Cartoon Voiceovers&quot;&gt;cartoons&lt;/a&gt;, delivered with professionalism and humour.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;!-- Mini Attenborough --&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;margin:20px 0;&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;audio controls style=&quot;width:100%; max-width:420px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;source src=&quot;https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/audio/david-attenborough-demo-25-guy-harris.mp3&quot; type=&quot;audio/mpeg&quot;&gt;\r\n    Your browser does not support the audio element.\r\n  &lt;/audio&gt;\r\n  &lt;p style=&quot;font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;&quot;&gt;\r\n    David Attenborough Voice Showreel &ndash; Guy Harris\r\n  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;'),
(185, 'seo18', 's5', '&lt;h2&gt;Common Questions About My Attenborough Voice&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Is David Attenborough&rsquo;s voice AI?&lt;/strong&gt; No. While there are &lt;a href=&quot;ai-guy-human-vs-ai-voiceover&quot; title=&quot;AI Voices&quot;&gt;AI&lt;/a&gt; versions out there, my impression is a natural performance, grounded in years of professional voiceover experience. I deliver nuance, timing and warmth that no algorithm can fully capture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where have people heard your Attenborough impression?&lt;/strong&gt; Across TV, games, trailers, social virals, and more. From &lt;a href=&quot;turkish-bird-attenborough-voice&quot; title=&quot;Social Media Attenborough&quot;&gt;lighthearted social media videos&lt;/a&gt; to serious narration worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Can you record live with direction?&lt;/strong&gt; Absolutely. I record with clients over &lt;a href=&quot;voiceover-studio&quot; title=&quot;Booking Attenborough with Zoom or Cleanfeed&quot;&gt;Zoom or Cleanfeed&lt;/a&gt;, so you can direct in real time. The final read is then exactly as you imagined it. All delivered in broadcast-quality audio the same day.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(186, 'seo18', 's6', '&lt;h2&gt;Ready to Book a David Attenborough Voice?&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Want to play around with the style yourself?&lt;br&gt;Try my &lt;a href=&quot;attenborough-script-generator&quot; title=&quot;attenborough script generator&quot;&gt;David Attenborough Script Generator&lt;/a&gt; for fun, AI-powered scripts. It&rsquo;s a fun way to test script writing, but if your project matters, let&rsquo;s keep it &lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;If you&rsquo;re after a respectful &lt;strong&gt;David Attenborough impersonator&lt;/strong&gt;, whether serious narration or spoof comedy, drop me a message and I&rsquo;ll send you a quick free sample before you commit. Most scripts are voiced the same day.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(187, 'seo18', 's7', 'tODqlSVh6hc'),
(188, 'seo18', 's8', 'diSuM7OMyGg'),
(189, 'seo19', 's1', 'Explainer Video Voice Over - Guy Harris - Voiceovers 4 Web'),
(190, 'seo19', 's2', 'Explainer Video Voice over | Guy Harris - VoiceoverGuy - Natural and Reassuring | The voice of hundreds of Web, Viral &amp;amp; How 2 Videos - British Voiceover'),
(191, 'seo19', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;Explaining the &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Explainer video&lt;/span&gt; voice &lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Explainer video voice is one picked on it&rsquo;s ability to make these 1 - 2 minute website videos have impact. &lt;br&gt;\r\nMy voice is heard on hundreds of Web videos. YouTube is alive with work. Why not request a sample of your script?&lt;/p&gt;'),
(192, 'seo19', 's4', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Web&lt;/span&gt; Videos&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There are some fantastic Explainer video producing companies making some awesome videos and animations. Believe me, I&rsquo;m working with them. So, your hard work and product should be represented with a credible voice. Working with major brands daily I know how to make your words sound great.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(193, 'seo19', 's5', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Who&lt;/span&gt; to use?&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Now, I&rsquo;m not saying you have to book me. If I&rsquo;m not right for your brand, I won&rsquo;t take money from a client who could go away un happy. I&rsquo;ll happily offer an alternative voice. It&rsquo;s really quite easy, if you need a more mature sound, a regional accent or maybe the product calls for a female voice? I&rsquo;ll help, no problem.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(194, 'seo19', 's6', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Simple&lt;/span&gt; and Easy&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Do you want a voiceover that wants to make the process as smooth as possible? Do you want to get along with the voice and them not be awkward and un co-operative? Will that voice charge you every time you need it tweaking or amending? Do you want them hounding you if you haven&rsquo;t paid within 2 days? Of course not. So, try me.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(195, 'seo19', 's7', '134788599'),
(196, 'seo19', 's8', '142797450'),
(197, 'seo19', 's10', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;How&lt;/span&gt; it works&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It&rsquo;s not rocket science, it&rsquo;s a voice over. However, you need the job done properly! If you choose me, thank you. I will of course offer to read a couple of lines first to check I&rsquo;m the right voice for your brand. Avoid going for cheap options. Is your brand in safe hands?&lt;/p&gt;'),
(198, 'seo19', 's11', '150788840'),
(199, 'seo19', 's12', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Lets&lt;/span&gt; do it!&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;I&rsquo;m voicing lots of Web, How 2 and Explainer videos daily. It never ceases to amaze me the content you guys create and then I get to place my vocals all over the top of it at the end. If you keep on creating and I&rsquo;ll keep voicing.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(200, 'seo19', 's13', '136879277'),
(201, 'seo19', 's14', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Web&lt;/span&gt; &amp; Explainer Voice!&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Web Videos, How 2 Videos, Corporate, e-Learning videos or your Explainer Video Voice&hellip; Maybe I&rsquo;ll be right for yours?\r\nIt&rsquo;s pretty cool when I re-fresh my email and along comes a job and I think&hellip; Yeah&hellip; Nice! So, shall we talk? &lt;br&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;contact-guy&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;The Contact Page&quot;&gt;The Contact Page&lt;/a&gt; to get in touch.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;'),
(202, 'seo19', 's15', '134789150'),
(203, 'seo19', 's9', '184425590'),
(204, 'seo20', 's1', 'Contact Guy Voiceover - British Male Voiceover'),
(205, 'seo20', 's2', 'Contact VoiceoverGuy - The Official Website of British Male Voiceover Guy Harris - Radio, TV, Explainers, In-Store, On-Hold, Games, Corporate, E-Learning'),
(206, 'seo20', 's3', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Contact&nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Guy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Email:&nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;ident&quot; href=&quot;mailto:guy@Voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Website enquiry&quot; title=&quot;eMail Guy direct now&quot;&gt;Guy@VoiceoverGuy.co.uk&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\nTel: +44 (0)7973 350 178&lt;br&gt;\r\nOr you can connect for LIVE sessions.&lt;br&gt;\r\nSource Connect NEXUS: &lt;a class=&quot;ident&quot; title=&quot;Source Connect NOW&quot; href=&quot;https://nexus.source-elements.com/voiceoverguy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;VoiceoverGuy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\nCleanFeed: &lt;a class=&quot;ident&quot; title=&quot;Cleanfeed login (open in Chrome)&quot; href=&quot;https://cleanfeed.net/join?voiceoverguy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;VoiceoverGuy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\nIt&#039;s always great to hear from new clients. &lt;br&gt;Please do get in touch and lets make your project sound epic!\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(207, 'seo20', 's4', '&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top: 40px;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;a href=&quot;voiceover-cartoons&quot; title=&quot;Guy Harris - Commercial Voiceover&quot; &gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;Guy Harris - Voiceover &quot; title=&quot;Guy Harris - Voiceover&quot; class=&quot;img-responsive&quot;   src=&quot;assets/images/voiceover-contact.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;'),
(208, 'seo20', 's5', '&lt;h2&gt;So,&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt; whats it gonna &lt;/span&gt;cost then?&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;li2&gt;Give as much detail as you can about the project&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;Let us know the style or tone of voice you&#039;re after&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;The estimated word count or running time of your script&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;Indicate the intended usage. ie. web, radio, tv etc&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;We will then send you an accurate quote for your project&lt;/li2&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;You&rsquo;d like to Pay? We&rsquo;d love you to&hellip;&lt;/h2&gt;'),
(209, 'seo20', 's6', '&lt;h2&gt;What do&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt; you&lt;/span&gt; get?&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;An easy and professional service from start to finish.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;A bespoke sample if required to make sure I&#039;m the right voice.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;Directed or self recorded, studio quality audio the same day.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;We will work together until you get the desired outcome.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;All audio is broadcast quality from a professional recording studio.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(210, 'seo20', 's7', 'ff'),
(211, 'seo20', 's8', 'fff'),
(212, 'seo21', 's1', 'Voiceover Videos - TV &amp; Web examples of voiceoverGuy'),
(213, 'seo21', 's2', 'Voiceover Videos of voice artist Guy Harris. TV, Explainer Videos, Viral, Web Videos - Plus a stack more to view on Guy&#039;s Vimeo or YouTube Channel.'),
(214, 'seo21', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Voiceover&lt;/span&gt; Videos&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A selection of the work showcasing some of the brands Guy works with on a daily basis.&lt;br&gt;\r\nTV &amp; Radio, Game Trailers, Radio and Explainer Videos. This page should give you a flavour of who you are about to book.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(215, 'seo21', 's4', '&lt;p&gt;Guy Harris is full time voice over artist with 20+ years experience. Audio is delivered from his high quality professional &lt;a href=&quot;voiceover-studio&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;The studio&quot;&gt;studio&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;\r\nOn a weekly basis Guy is asked to add his voice to over 100+ different projects. From TV &amp; Radio adverts to on hold and explainer videos.&lt;br&gt;\r\nThis is just a small collection of some of the recent work. For a stack more of Guy&#039;s voice over work and audio click the &lt;a href=&quot;voiceover-news&quot; title=&quot;News &amp; Blog&quot;&gt;News &amp; Blog&lt;/a&gt; section. &lt;br&gt;\r\nIf you are looking for a voice for your production then &lt;a class=&quot;ident&quot; href=&quot;mailto:Guy@Voiceoverguy.co.uk&quot;&gt;get in touch &lt;/a&gt;for a quote.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(216, 'seo21', 's5', ''),
(217, 'seo21', 's6', ''),
(218, 'seo21', 's7', ''),
(219, 'seo21', 's8', ''),
(220, 'seo22', 's1', 'Source Connect NOW - Connect now by IP - Guy Harris'),
(221, 'seo22', 's2', 'Source Connect NOW - Connect with Guy from the website at VoiceoverGuy.co.uk  Load the page on Google Chrome and have a High Quality connection by IP'),
(222, 'seo22', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Source&lt;/span&gt; Connect NOW&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Connect and direct right now with Source Connect NOW. &lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;Ok clever clogs! So,  &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;how &lt;/span&gt;do I get it working?&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ensure &lt;a href=&quot;https://now.source-elements.com/#!/guest/voiceoverguy/128/1&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Guy&#039;s Source Connect Page&quot;&gt;THIS PAGE&lt;/a&gt; is loaded up on Google Chrome or Canary.&lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;/p&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n1. Enter your name&lt;br&gt;\r\n2. Enter the &lsquo;pass key&rsquo; (sent to you before the session)&lt;br&gt;\r\n3. Click &lsquo;connect&rsquo;&lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;li2&gt;You can now direct the session or record it in HQ over the web.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;If you can&#039;t record Guy, we will do it for you and send it after.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;Multiple users can dial in to listen or comment.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;Direct or listen in right from your desktop or laptop.&lt;/li2&gt;&lt;/p&gt;'),
(223, 'seo22', 's4', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;So, why are we using &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;this voice?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;Guy is a full time voiceover artist of 20+years.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;You are connected to his high quality pro studio in Yorkshire.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;He works with big name brands daily.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;An great understanding of what you need to achieve.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;Lets face it, you are in safe hands.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;voiceover-news&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;&#039;News &amp; Blog&#039;&quot;&gt;&#039;News &amp; Blog&#039;&lt;/a&gt; to see Guy&#039;s latest work.&lt;br&gt;\r\nThanks again for connecting.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(224, 'seo19', 's16', '&lt;p&gt;Explainers or web videos are a visual way of putting the message across whilst also forcing businesses to say more in less words.&lt;br&gt;\r\nIt&rsquo;s job is add an audio enhancement to these short promotional videos of a company or brand. &lt;br&gt;\r\nWhy are they short? A user&rsquo;s attention is a lot shorter these days and expect to be introduced to a product quickly.&lt;br&gt;\r\nI&#039;ve voiced hundreds of explainer videos for global brands like Tesco, Vodafone, Sage, RBS, Unilever, John West, Coca Cola, Rolls Royce &amp; N-Power.&lt;br&gt;\r\nShort 1-2 minute web videos are dominating home pages all over the web. But what is most important? The Voice!&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;'),
(225, 'seo23', 's1', 'Apple TV App development 4 Radio stations'),
(226, 'seo23', 's2', 'Apple TV App - Is your Radio Station on the new Apple TV? Let your listeners now listen to your station via your own app developed for the new Apple TV'),
(227, 'seo23', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;App&lt;/span&gt; Development&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2&gt;Stream your Radio station on all mobile devices and even on the NEW Apple TV&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;We can develop your radio station it&#039;s own branded app to stream to millions of potentials listeners.&lt;br&gt;\r\nAs well as developing apps for mobile devices we also develop apps for the iMac,  MacBook&rsquo;s and Apple TV&lt;br&gt;\r\nHaving your own app allows you to engage with your listeners in a whole new way,. It also improves brand awareness massively&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;Affordable app development to get your radio station heard!&lt;/h2&gt;'),
(228, 'seo23', 's4', '&lt;h2&gt;Our service &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;includes:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;Custom app design to match your current branding.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;We can develop you a streaming radio app for the iPhone, iPod Touch, iPad, iMac, Macbook, Apple TV, Android on Google Play, and Amazon devices.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;We can add an app to your existing developer account. Anyone with it already on their phone, can download to their Apple TV.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;No annual fee, and no hidden costs.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;Payment only once the App is approved by the app store.&lt;/li2&gt;\r\n&lt;li2&gt;Up and running quickly too.&lt;/li2&gt;'),
(229, 'seo23', 's5', '&lt;h2&gt;Want an &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;example&lt;/span&gt; of our work?&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Check out &lt;a class=&quot;ident&quot; href=&quot;https://www.santaradio.co.uk/&quot; title=&quot;Santa Radio&quot;&gt;Santa Radio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\nYou can download our free Santa Radio app for Apple TV, iPhone, iPad, iMac, Macbook, Android and Amazon.&lt;br&gt;\r\nOur App plays Christmas music 24/7, 365 days a year.&lt;br&gt;\r\nHosted by Santa, it&rsquo;s also commercial free.&lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;br&gt;\r\nFor details of what we can offer your Radio Station, please feel free to get in touch with us&lt;br&gt;\r\nappletv@voiceoverguy.co.uk&lt;/p&gt;'),
(230, 'seo23', 's6', ''),
(231, 'seo23', 's7', ''),
(232, 'seo23', 's8', ''),
(233, 'seo24', 's1', 'Voiceover Cartoons - The lighter side of The Voiceover World'),
(234, 'seo24', 's2', 'Voiceover Cartoons - a cartoon collection looking at the funnier side of the Voiceover business - Cartoons by Voiceover Guy Harris - VoiceoverGuy.co.uk'),
(235, 'seo24', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;The &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Voiceover&lt;/span&gt; Cartoons&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;As a voiceover for 16+ years, along the way, I&rsquo;ve experienced a lot of situations and scenarios I&rsquo;ve found amusing.&lt;br&gt;\r\nSo, along with my unique sense of humour I hope I&rsquo;ve captured various elements of what we do that will raise a smile. &lt;br&gt;\r\nEvery day is different in this job yet there are similarities that make me smile daily. Hence making these Voiceover Cartoons.&lt;br&gt;\r\nTo some viewers outside of the voiceover industry, most of these won&rsquo;t mean anything and not that funny. &lt;br&gt;\r\nFor those connected to this industry, then hopefully these voiceover cartoons should get an approving nod.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(236, 'seo24', 's4', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Cartoons&lt;/span&gt; for Voiceover&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you have any ideas from our voiceover world you think there are other cartoons just waiting to be drawn, please do let me know.&lt;br&gt;\r\nAlways open to suggestions for other humourous ideas that we can turn into Voiceover Cartoons.&lt;br&gt;\r\nThe amazing cartoons are designed by Guy Harris and illustrated by &lt;a class=&quot;ident&quot; href=&quot;https://georgearaggett.bigcartel.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;George Raggett&quot;&gt;George Raggett&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do have a good look around the website and you are sure to find a style that would suit your project.&lt;br&gt;The search box on the home page should help you navigate to a style or tone you need. &lt;br&gt;Or do check out the &lt;a href=&quot;voiceover-news&quot; title=&quot;News and Blog Page&quot;&gt;News and Blog&lt;/a&gt; page. You&#039;ll see some of the projects I&#039;ve already been a part of.&lt;/p&gt;'),
