(281, 'seo25', 's1', 'Voiceover Studio Yorkshire | Cleanfeed , Teams &amp; Zoom'),
(282, 'seo25', 's2', 'Guy Harris Voiceover Studio | Based in Yorkshire - Rivals some of the London facilities. One of the best voiceover booths in the UK | Available daily.'),
(283, 'seo25', 's3', '&lt;h1&gt;Yorkshire Voiceover &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Studio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;My professional voiceover studio based in West Yorkshire rivals some of the London facilities, with a 2022 refit.&lt;br&gt;\r\nIt&rsquo;s loaded with the latest technology and is connectable in every way possible for you to direct the voice session.&lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;b&gt;360&deg; tour below.&lt;/b&gt; Click the mouse and move left, right up and down to see the whole studio.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(284, 'seo25', 's4', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;VoiceoverGuy Studio&lt;/span&gt; kit&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.neumann.com/en-gb/products/microphones/u-87-ai&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Neumann U87&quot;&gt;Neumann U87&lt;/a&gt;, TLM 103, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sennheiser.com/en-us/catalog/products/microphones/mkh-416-p48u3/mkh-416-p48u3-001511&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Sennheiser MKH 416&quot;&gt;Sennheiser MKH 416&lt;/a&gt;. \r\n&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.adobe.com/uk/products/audition.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Adobe Audition VoiceoverGuy&quot;&gt;Adobe Audition&lt;/a&gt; recording software.&lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.uaudio.com/products/apollo-x4&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Apollo X4&quot;&gt;Apollo X4&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.uaudio.com/products/apollo-x6&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Apollo X6&quot;&gt;Apollo X6&lt;/a&gt; Audio Interfaces.\r\n\r\n&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.uaudio.com/products/neve-1073-collection&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;NEVE 1073 Pre Amp&quot;&gt;NEVE 1073&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.uaudio.com/products/teletronix-la-2a-tube-compressor&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;LA-2A&quot;&gt;LA-2A&lt;/a&gt; and  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.uaudio.com/products/neve-88rs-collection&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;NEVE 88RS&quot;&gt;NEVE 88RS&lt;/a&gt; Pre Amps&lt;br&gt;\r\n\r\nWe even love the conveniency of 2 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elgato.com/us/en/s/explore-stream-deck&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Stream Deck&quot;&gt;Stream Deck&lt;/a&gt; units.&lt;br&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;b&gt;Listen in and direct the session with:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://nexus.source-elements.com/voiceoverguy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Source Connect NEXUS&quot;&gt;Source Connect NEXUS, &lt;/a&gt;\r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://cleanfeed.net/join?voiceoverguy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;VoiceoverGuy Cleanfeed link&quot;&gt;Cleanfeed&lt;/a&gt;, SessionLinkPro, Zoom &amp; Teams.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(285, 'seo25', 's5', '&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Listen and Direct &lt;/span&gt;the Voiceover Session&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There&rsquo;s no need to travel. Most clients now direct remotely, live in HD quality, using Source Connect, Cleanfeed, or Zoom. You can listen in, give feedback, and guide the read in real time.&lt;br&gt;\r\n\r\nGuy is regularly directed live for his in demand &lt;a href=&quot;/david-attenborough-voice&quot; title=&quot;David Attenborough Impression Voiceover&quot;&gt;David Attenborough impression&lt;/a&gt;, used in TV, web, radio, and social media campaigns. If you&rsquo;re after a natural history-style voiceover with warmth and wit, this is where to start.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(286, 'seo25', 's6', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;A &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Cleanfeed &lt;/span&gt;Studio&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Clean feed is awesome! It&rsquo;s an awesome way to connect the Voiceover to a Studio, or even to connect you remotely to listen in with the cost of hiring a studio. All you need is Google Chrome. &lt;br&gt;Guy will send you his Cleanfeed link.&lt;/a&gt; Simply open in Chrome and listen in High Quality or record your end without needing to book a studio. Click the &lt;a href=&quot;https://cleanfeed.net/&quot; class=&quot;isred&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Cleanfeed Website&quot;&gt;Cleanfeed website&lt;/a&gt; for more details.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(287, 'seo25', 's7', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Source Connect &lt;/span&gt;NEXUS &amp; Standard&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Source-Connect Now enables audio direction between the studio and your Mac or PC using Google Chrome. You can also literally be anywhere in the world and connect. &lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;a href=&quot;https://nexus.source-elements.com/voiceoverguy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Source Connect NEXUS&quot;&gt;Click the link, &lt;/a&gt; and it allows direct-to-the-timeline recording with real-time, broadcast-quality audio using only your internet connection. Many great sessions have been directed this way.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(288, 'seo25', 's8', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Need a Voiceover or Podcast Studio in Yorkshire?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nLooking for a professional recording space in West Yorkshire? This studio is used by ITV, BBC, and top podcast\r\nproducers to connect guests remotely or record interviews in broadcast quality.&lt;br&gt;\r\nWhether you&rsquo;re interviewing a guest for a podcast, directing a remote voice session, or need a Source Connect&ndash;enabled\r\nstudio for a live radio link-up, it&rsquo;s all here.&lt;br&gt;\r\nIf you specifically need a dedicated podcast space, take a look at my\r\n&lt;a href=&quot;/yorkshire-podcast-studio&quot; title=&quot;Yorkshire Podcast Studio for hire&quot;&gt;Yorkshire podcast studio&lt;/a&gt; page for more\r\ndetails and example sessions.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(289, 'seo25', 's9', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Need a Yorkshire Studio for &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Interviews?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nFrom live radio link-ups to remote podcast interviews, this studio connects guests across the UK and beyond.&lt;br&gt;\r\nUsed by ITV&rsquo;s Emmerdale, BBC, Heart and even Kammy, it&rsquo;s perfect for producers needing a local voice or expert. &lt;br&gt;\r\nThat&rsquo;s exactly why &lt;a class=&quot;ident&quot; href=&quot;https://voiceoverstudiofinder.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Voiceover Studio Finder&quot;&gt;Voiceover Studio Finder&lt;/a&gt; was created, to help producers find studios like this, wherever they need them.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(290, 'seo25', 's10', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Voiceover Studio Hire in Yorkshire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;\r\nLooking for a professional voice studio to rent in Yorkshire? Set in a discreet, easily accessible location with private\r\nparking, this studio is trusted by voiceover talent from ITV&rsquo;s &lt;em&gt;Emmerdale&lt;/em&gt; and even football legend Chris Kamara.&lt;br&gt;\r\nPart of the &lt;a class=&quot;ident&quot; href=&quot;https://voiceoverstudiofinder.com/&quot; title=&quot;Voiceover Studio Finder&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Voiceover Studio Finder&lt;/a&gt; network, it&rsquo;s fully equipped for remote sessions and in-person recordings.&lt;br&gt;\r\nIf you have further questions do check out our &lt;a href=&quot;FAQ&quot; title=&quot;FAQ Page&quot;&gt;FAQ Page&lt;/a&gt;.\r\n&lt;a class=&quot;ident&quot; href=&quot;contact-guy&quot; title=&quot;Get in touch with Guy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Get in touch&lt;/a&gt; to check availability\r\nor view &lt;a class=&quot;ident&quot; href=&quot;https://voiceoverstudiofinder.com/voiceoverguy&quot; title=&quot;Guy&rsquo;s Studio on Voiceover Studio Finder&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Guy&rsquo;s studio profile&lt;/a&gt; on Voiceover Studio Finder for more technical specs and photos.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(291, 'seo26', 's9', 'Af5szC15B_8'),
(292, 'seo26', 's10', 'yYJYxKKF7ac'),
(293, 'seo26', 's11', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Kings&lt;/span&gt; Road Trailer&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The app market is developing so fast these days and keeping track of all the latest games is so incredibly hard.  However, most need or deserve a great trailer.&lt;br&gt;\r\nAn English voice with a darker edge was required for this one. Getting up close and personal on the MK-416 microphone, this turned out rather nice.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;'),
(294, 'seo26', 's12', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt; Dreamworks &lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;Home &lt;/span&gt;Boov Pop&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s not everyday you get to work with Dreamworks and their name was certainly on the whiteboard here for many years as an ambition.&lt;br&gt;\r\nHOME was the hit animated movie and Boov Pop was the spin off video game. &lt;br&gt;An over the top American voice needed and it was launched on a screen in Times Square New York.&lt;/p&gt;'),
(295, 'seo26', 's22', '1'),
(296, 'seo26', 's23', '1'),
(297, 'seo2', 's10', '&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ident&quot;&gt;The UK&rsquo;s No.1 Voice of Santa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  \r\n&lt;p&gt;It&rsquo;s not Christmas without the Voice of Santa! As the go-to Santa for BBC, ITV, Heart Radio, and even Tesco, I&rsquo;ve brought the magic of Christmas to life for years. From live broadcasts and national campaigns to personalised films and festive events, my &lt;a href=&quot;santa-voice&quot; title=&quot;Professional Santa Voiceover by Guy Harris&quot;&gt;Santa voice&lt;/a&gt; is trusted by top brands to spread joy and cheer.  \r\n&lt;br&gt;  \r\nI also run &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.santaradio.co.uk&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; title=&quot;Santa Radio, The World&rsquo;s Biggest Online Christmas Radio Station&quot;&gt;Santa Radio&lt;/a&gt; &mdash; the world&rsquo;s biggest online Christmas station, broadcasting festive favourites 365 days a year.  \r\n&lt;br&gt;  \r\nYou might&rsquo;ve heard me in campaigns for &lt;a href=&quot;/masked-singer-voice-of-god-butlins&quot; title=&quot;Masked Singer Voiceover for Butlins&quot;&gt;Butlins&lt;/a&gt;, ITV&rsquo;s In for a Penny, and Paultons Park. A familiar festive voice across the UK. If your project needs an authentic, joyful Santa voice that captivates audiences, I can create the perfect Christmas atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;'),
(298, 'seo10', 's10', 'BOT TEXT'),
(299, 'seo10', 's11', 'lw3_DUx5jrk'),
(300, 'seo10', 's24', '1'),
(301, 'seo26', 's13', '4hHuiPqQkvs'),
